(9, 'Ambassador', 'IT Park', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'IT Park Uzbekistan is Looking for Ambassadors from MDIS Tashkent! \r\nAre you passionate about technology, innovation, and community building? IT Park Uzbekistan is looking for motivated students from MDIST to become IT Park Ambassadors', 'upl/logo/1740469563_Без названия.png', 'Responsibilities as an Ambassador: Organize and promote IT Park events at MDIST; Encourage students to participate in IT Park activities.', 'Who Can Apply?\r\nAny motivated student from MDIST with a passion for tech, events, and community building!', 'Benefits of Becoming an IT Park Ambassador:\r\nLeadership & event management experience\r\n\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p> \r\nNetworking with IT professionals', '0', '2025-07-29 10:21:22', 1, 1, 3, 10, '2025-02-12 05:44:17', '2025-07-29 10:21:22'),
(18, 'Financier/Economist', 'Orient Finans Bank', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Employment in Orient Finance IS is carried out on a competitive basis. Competitive selection is the process of evaluating candidates who meet the requirements for a specific position. Those wishing to join the successful team of professionals can apply here or send their resume (CV) to the following email: info@ofb.uz', 'upl/logo/1739779419_OrientFinanceBank_mini.png', 'Analysis of accounting and financial reports. Candidate Requirements:', 'Qualifications & Skills: • Level 6 student or graduate with a degree in Economics, Finance, or related fields; • Knowledge of English at level B2+; • Previous work experience: Ideal 1-3 years; • Strong stress resistance and ability to handle multitasking; • Excellent communication and interpersonal skills; • Knowledge of Russian and Uzbek languages.', 'Career Growth & Development: • Gain practical experience in financial management. • Work in a reputable bank, enhancing career prospects in the finance industry. • Develop analytical and problem-solving skills by working with financial data and reports. 📌 Professional Skill Enhancement: • Strengthen financial analysis and accounting skills by preparing reports.\r\n\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:21:47', 1, 0, 11, 6, '2025-02-13 20:07:24', '2025-07-29 10:21:47'),
(19, 'Junior Data Analyst', 'Ipoteka Bank', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'JSCMB \"Ipoteka Bank\"\r\nJunior Data Analyst\r\nThe job entails data preparation, monitoring performance indicators, conducting trend analysis, supporting predictive modeling, and developing analytical reports.\r\nWebsite\r\nhttps://www.ipotekabank.uz/en/\r\nAgent\r\nJSCMB \"Ipoteka Bank\"', 'upl/logo/1739779489_oqwb9no7kpcejoapyyor688wolflyeu4.jpg', 'Analyze and interpret data to support decision-making in the retail risk management process.  Apply critical thinking to identify trends, patterns, and anomalies in data.  Assist in creating reports and visualizations to communicate findings effectively.  Collaborate with team members to ensure data quality and relevance for risk assessments.', 'Skills the candidate should have\r\nStrong critical thinking and data comprehension skills.\r\n\r\nBasic to intermediate data analysis capabilities.\r\nFamiliarity with programming languages (e.g., Python, R, SQL, etc.) is a plus.', 'Competitive Salary – Salary details are mentioned as \"During interview,\" implying potential negotiation based on experience.\r\nProfessional Development – Opportunities for training, certifications, and courses to improve analytical and programming skills.\r\nCareer Growth Opportunities – Potential for promotions within the organization based on performance.\r\nBonuses & Incentives – Performance-based bonuses and incentives may be provided.\r\n\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:22:36', 1, 0, 5, 6, '2025-02-13 20:29:38', '2025-07-29 10:22:36'),
(28, 'Customer Service Intern', 'BRIGHTBRIDGE LLC', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'BrightBridge is looking for a Customer Service Intern to gain hands-on experience in client relations, problem-solving, and service operations. This internship is ideal for students or recent graduates eager to develop skills in customer support and communication while working in a dynamic environment.', 'upl/logo/1740469671_logotr.png', 'Assist in handling customer inquiries and support requests. Learn to manage and use CRM tools to track customer interactions. Help resolve basic customer issues and escalate complex cases. Support the customer service team in improving response times and service quality. Gather and analyze customer feedback to improve the overall experience. Participate in team meetings and training sessions.', 'Currently pursuing or recently completed a degree in Business, Communications, or a related field. Strong verbal and written communication skills. Problem-solving mindset and a customer-focused attitude. Ability to multitask and work in a fast-paced environment. Basic knowledge of CRM tools and Microsoft Office (preferred).', 'Hands-on experience in customer service and client relations. Training and mentorship from industry professionals. Opportunity to develop communication and problem-solving skills. Potential for a full-time position after successful completion.', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-25 08:28:39', 1, 0, 3, 6, '2025-02-19 11:03:15', '2025-02-25 08:28:39'),
(29, 'test', 'BRIGHTBRIDGE LLC', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', '. Ta’lim va ilm-fan\r\n\r\nO‘qituvchi – dars o‘tish, o‘quvchilarga bilim berish, nazorat ishlari.\r\n\r\nProfessor / Dotsent – ilmiy maqola yozish, tadqiqot olib borish, talabalarni yo‘naltirish.\r\n\r\nTarbiyachi (maktabgacha) – bolalarni tarbiyalash va dastlabki bilim berish.\r\n\r\nIlmiy xodim – tadqiqot loyihalarini ishlab chiqish va amalga oshirish.\r\n\r\n2. Tibbiyot va sog‘liqni saqlash\r\n\r\nShifokor (terapevt, jarroh, pediatr, stomatolog) – tashxis qo‘yish va davolash.\r\n\r\nHamshira – bemorlarga qarash, dori-darmon berish.\r\n\r\nFarmatsevt – dorilarni tayyorlash va tarqatish.\r\n\r\nPsixolog – inson ruhiyatini tahlil qilish, maslahat berish.\r\n\r\n3. Axborot texnologiyalari (IT)\r\n\r\nDasturchi – mobil va veb dasturlar yaratish.\r\n\r\nMa’lumotlar bazasi administratori – ma’lumotlarni boshqarish.\r\n\r\nKiberxavfsizlik mutaxassisi – tizimlarni hujumlardan himoya qilish.\r\n\r\nSun’iy intellekt muhandisi – AI modellarini ishlab chiqish.\r\n\r\n4. Iqtisodiyot va biznes\r\n\r\nBuxgalter – hisob-kitoblar, hisobot tayyorlash.\r\n\r\nAuditor – moliyaviy tekshiruv va nazorat.\r\n\r\nMoliyachi (Finance Manager) – investitsiya va pul oqimlarini boshqarish.\r\n\r\nMarketolog (Marketing Specialist) – bozorni tahlil qilish, reklama strategiyalari yaratish.\r\n\r\nHR-menejer – xodimlarni tanlash va boshqarish.\r\n\r\nLoyiha menejeri – loyihalarni rejalashtirish va nazorat qilish.\r\n\r\n5. Transport va logistika\r\n\r\nTaksi haydovchisi – yo‘lovchilarni xavfsiz manzilga yetkazish.\r\n\r\nYuk mashinasi haydovchisi – tovarlarni tashish.\r\n\r\nAviadispetcher – samolyot parvozlarini boshqarish.\r\n\r\nLogistika mutaxassisi – yetkazib berish jarayonini nazorat qilish.\r\n\r\n6. Texnika va muhandislik\r\n\r\nMuhandis – qurilish, mexanik yoki elektr sohada loyihalar yaratish.\r\n\r\nArxitektor – bino va inshootlarni loyihalash.\r\n\r\nTexnik – jihozlarni sozlash va ta’mirlash.\r\n\r\nQuruvchi – turli qurilish ishlarini bajarish.\r\n\r\n7. Huquq va davlat boshqaruvi\r\n\r\nAdvokat – mijoz huquqlarini himoya qilish.\r\n\r\nSudya – qonun asosida hukm chiqarish.\r\n\r\nProkuror – jinoyatlarni nazorat qilish va tergov.\r\n\r\nDavlat xizmatchisi – davlat siyosatini amalga oshirish.\r\n\r\n8. San’at va madaniyat\r\n\r\nSan’atkor (Qo‘shiqchi, Rassom, Aktyor) – ijod qilish va chiqishlar.\r\n\r\nKutubxonachi – kitoblarni tartibga solish va xizmat ko‘rsatish.\r\n\r\nDizayner (grafik, moda, interyer) – estetik loyihalar yaratish.\r\n\r\nMuzeyshunos – tarixiy eksponatlarni saqlash va targ‘ib qilish.\r\n\r\n9. Qishloq xo‘jaligi\r\n\r\nDehqon – ekin ekish, hosil yetishtirish.\r\n\r\nFermer – chorvachilik va bog‘dorchilik.\r\n\r\nAgrotexnolog – zamonaviy qishloq xo‘jalik texnologiyalarini tatbiq qilish.\r\n\r\nVeterinar – hayvonlarni davolash.\r\n\r\n10. Xizmat ko‘rsatish\r\n\r\nOshpaz – taom tayyorlash va xizmat ko‘rsatish.\r\n\r\nSartarosh – soch turmaklash.\r\n\r\nVizajist – bo‘yanish xizmatlari.\r\n\r\nSavdo xodimi – mahsulot sotish, mijozlarga yordam berish.\r\n\r\nTurizm menejeri – sayyohlar uchun xizmat tashkil qilish.', 'upl/logo/1739779529_vvvvvv.jpg', 'Analysrwrwis and preparation of accounting and financial reports.', 'test', 'test', 'Negotiable', '2025-10-01 07:41:00', 0, 0, 1, 6, '2025-02-22 05:49:14', '2025-10-01 07:41:00'),
(30, 'Junior Cybersecurity Consultant', 'KPMG AUDIT', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'KPMG\r\n\r\nLet your curiosity lead you\r\n\r\nGraduate and undergraduate opportunities\r\n\r\nSeeking a motivated Junior Cybersecurity Consultant with 1–3 years of experience to join our team. This is a full-time, on-site role focused on assessing security risks, implementing protective measures, and ensuring compliance with cybersecurity standards. Ideal candidates should have a strong understanding of threat analysis, network security, and security frameworks. Competitive salary offered.\r\n\r\nKPMG in Uzbekistan\r\n\r\nkpmg.co.uz', 'upl/logo/1740460053_images.png', 'Leading Client Engagements – Manage and oversee client relationships, ensuring project success. Supervising Teams – Lead and mentor junior staff in audits, consulting, or advisory projects. Strategic Decision-Making – Develop and implement business strategies for clients. Project Management – Oversee end-to-end project execution, budgeting, and stakeholder communication.', 'Leading Client Engagements – Manage and oversee client relationships, ensuring project success.\r\n\r\nQualifications: Bachelor\'s or Master\'s degree in Accounting, Finance, Business, or related field; 2+ years of professional experience in consulting, auditing, or advisory.\r\nSupervising Teams – Lead and mentor junior staff in audits, consulting, or advisory projects.\r\n\r\nQualifications: Strong leadership skills, prior experience in managing teams, and proficiency in financial reporting and regulatory compliance.\r\nStrategic Decision-Making – Develop and implement business strategies for clients.\r\n\r\nQualifications: Experience in business analysis, market research, and strategic planning; ability to interpret financial data and industry trends.\r\nProject Management – Oversee end-to-end project execution, budgeting, and stakeholder communication.\r\n\r\nQualifications: Project management certification (PMP preferred), excellent organizational and problem-solving skills, and experience handling multiple projects simultaneously.', 'Benefits:\r\nCompetitive salary package\r\nWhere to find us\r\nWebsite: kpmg.co.uz or send your CV to personnel-uz@kpmg.com\r\nThis internship is ideal for recent graduates or students seeking to gain valuable industry experience in infrastructure investment and deal advisory while working in a professional and structured environment.\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/kpmgcareerca\" target=\"_blank\"> KPMG Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/uz/en/home/careers/graduate/vacancies.html\" target=\"_blank\">KPMG Official Website</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://uz.linkedin.com/company/kpmguzbekistan\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-26 21:08:36', 1, 1, 5, 6, '2025-02-25 05:00:51', '2025-02-26 21:08:36'),
(31, 'Intern-Executive 1, Infrastructure, Deal Advisory', 'KPMG AUDIT', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'As an Intern-Executive 1 in the Infrastructure sector within Deal Advisory, you will be part of a dynamic team providing strategic advice on infrastructure projects, investments, and financial structuring. This role offers a hands-on experience in deal structuring, market analysis, and financial modeling, making it an excellent opportunity for aspiring professionals looking to build expertise in infrastructure advisory and investment analysis. As an Intern/Executive 1 in the Infrastructure team, you will:\r\n\r\nCollaborate on High-Impact Projects: Partner with industry experts to deliver thorough assessments and solutions for transformative infrastructure projects.\r\nAnalyze Financial Performance: Dive deep into financial statements and operational data to assess value drivers and provide actionable insights for clients.\r\nDrive Strategic Decisions with Market Research: Conduct and interpret market studies to guide clients\' decisions.\r\nDevelop Financial Models: Construct and present financial models that support valuation conclusions and strategic recommendations.\r\nPrepare Client Deliverables: Create reports, proposals, contracts, and other project-related documentation, ensuring clarity and professionalism in presentation.\r\nYou’re the perfect match for this role if you:\r\n\r\nHold a degree from a leading university in Uzbekistan, or internationally.\r\nHave a solid understanding of financial accounting, valuation methods, and market comparison analysis.\r\nPossess experience in audit, transaction support, or corporate finance (an advantage).\r\nAre pursuing or have obtained CFA or ACCA certification (a plus).\r\nDemonstrate strong analytical skills, including numeracy, data structuring, and advanced research abilities.\r\nExhibit excellent writing and presentation skills for effective communication.\r\nAre a fast learner, team player, and possess strong communication skills.\r\nCan prioritize tasks effectively to meet tight deadlines with attention to detail.\r\nApproach problems with creativity and adapt quickly to changes in a dynamic environment.\r\nHave fluent English skills (both written and spoken) for communication with clients and colleagues.', 'upl/logo/1740468519_images.png', 'Key Responsibilities: Conduct research and analysis on infrastructure investment opportunities Assist in financial modeling, market assessments, and feasibility studies Support due diligence processes and transaction structuring Prepare reports, presentations, and documentation for internal and client meetings Collaborate with senior team members on deal execution and advisory services', 'Qualifications & Skills:\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\nBasic knowledge of financial analysis and infrastructure projects is a plus\r\nProficiency in MS Office (Excel, PowerPoint, Word)\r\nAbility to work independently and in a team environment\r\nExcellent communication and presentation skills', 'This internship is ideal for recent graduates or students seeking to gain valuable industry experience in infrastructure investment and deal advisory while working in a professional and structured environment.\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/kpmgcareerca\" target=\"_blank\"> KPMG Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/uz/en/home/careers/graduate/vacancies.html\" target=\"_blank\">KPMG Official Website</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://uz.linkedin.com/company/kpmguzbekistan\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>\r\n    </p>\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:21:11', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-02-25 06:49:05', '2025-07-29 10:21:11'),
(32, 'Financial Analyst', 'Deloitte', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Deloitte is one of the world’s leading professional services firms, providing Audit and Assurance, Tax and Legal, Consulting, Financial Advisory, Risk Advisory, and other services to public and private companies spanning multiple industries.\r\n\r\n \r\nWith a globally connected network of member firms, Deloitte has operations in more than 150 countries, bringing world-class capabilities and in-depth local expertise to help its clients succeed in a challenging environment. More than 275,000 Deloitte experts are dedicated to the concept of achieving results we can be proud of.\r\n\r\n \r\nDeloitte is represented by cross-functional industry groups that help clients find the right business solution based on market requirements. We constantly track the latest amendments in various sectors of the economy and offer our expert opinion on how they may affect business. We are consistently recognized as a market leader for the high quality of our services and our unique corporate culture.\r\n\r\n \r\nDeloitte has been operating in Kazakhstan for more than 25 years. The first office was opened in Almaty in 1993. Since June 2005, it coordinates the firm\'s operations in the Caspian region. We are the fastest-growing Big Four firm in Central Asia with the offices in Kazakhstan (Almaty, Astana, Atyrau, Aktau), Kyrgyzstan (Bishkek), Uzbekistan (Tashkent), and Tajikistan (Dushanbe), employing nearly 600 professionals throughout the region. As a result, we serve 40 out of Top-100 companies in Kazakhstan.\r\n\r\n \r\nReflecting back, and looking forward to the future, we maintain a long-term perspective and seek to make an impact that matters for our people, clients, and society. We are looking for a Financial Analyst to support our finance team with data analysis, budgeting, and forecasting to drive business decisions.', 'upl/logo/1740565763_CI.Profile.Deloitte.jpg', 'Analyze financial data and trends Prepare financial reports and forecasts Assist in budgeting and investment decisions Collaborate with other departments for financial planning', 'Bachelor\'s degree in Finance, Economics, or Accounting (current students can apply)\r\nStrong analytical and numerical skills\r\nExperience with financial modeling and reporting\r\nProficiency in Excel and financial software', 'Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses\r\nHealth insurance and paid vacation\r\nCareer growth and professional development opportunities\r\nAll current job vacancies with descriptions are available on the website: https://tashkent.hh.uz/employer/3575546.\r\nFor any questions, please write to uzcareers@deloitte.com.\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://www2.deloitte.com/kz/en.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Deloitte Official Website</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=8UXaNizdH02vE1q-RrmZIUdg5E-tQxNEjqoXmg1tps9UM1RTUVc0VjhZWkdYRlNPV1U0WUpUOE0wSi4u\" target=\"_blank\">Candidate form for Filling out</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/deloittedku?igsh=MTI3d2QycndjM2Zyag==\" target=\"_blank\">Deloitte Instagram</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-26 19:18:12', 1, 0, 11, 6, '2025-02-26 10:07:44', '2025-02-26 19:18:12'),
(33, 'HR Intern', 'Wings Distribution Company (WDC)', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Part-time', 'Wings is looking for an enthusiastic HR Intern to join our team. This role provides hands-on experience in human resources, including recruitment, employee relations, and administrative support. Successful candidates will have the opportunity to transition into a full-time role based on performance.', 'upl/logo/1740596883_images.png', 'Assist with recruitment processes, including screening resumes and scheduling interviews. Support HR documentation and employee records management. Help organize training sessions and onboarding programs. Provide administrative support to the HR team.', 'Currently enrolled in or recently graduated from a relevant university program (HR, Business Administration, or related field).\r\nStrong communication and organizational skills.\r\nAbility to work independently and manage multiple tasks.\r\nBasic knowledge of HR principles is a plus.', 'Official employment with a part-time schedule (0.5 FTE).\r\nFlexible working hours.\r\n\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p> \r\nTraining and career growth opportunities.\r\nPotential for full-time employment based on performance.\r\nContact Information:\r\n📞 +998900123313\r\n📩 @wings.careers\r\n\r\nThis opportunity is ideal for students and young professionals looking to kick-start their career in HR with a reputable company.\r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wings.careers/\" target=\"_blank\"> WINGS Instagram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://www.pgcareers.com/mea/en/locations/uzbekistan\" target=\"_blank\">PGC Official Website</a> <br>\r\n          </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:21:33', 1, 1, 6, 6, '2025-02-26 19:05:31', '2025-07-29 10:21:33'),
(34, 'Consulting Intern', 'UBI Consulting LLC', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Part-time', 'UBI Consulting LLC\r\nCurrently pursuing or recently completed a degree in Business, Economics, Finance, or a related field.\r\nUBI Consulting LLC is a multi-industrial engineering and consulting company, which provides high quality services for consulting in the development, restructuring, construction and modernization of structures and objects to local and international organizations, private and public clients of CIS. The company has a perennial international experience in project implementation in such areas as consulting in infrastructure development, business processes, human resources management and engineering spheres.', 'upl/logo/1740598413_1631385270450.jpg', 'Assist in conducting research and data analysis for client projects. Support consultants in preparing reports, presentations, and recommendations. Participate in meetings and client interactions. Contribute to problem-solving sessions and brainstorming activities. Assist with market analysis and business strategy development. Perform administrative and project coordination tasks as needed.', 'Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.\r\nExcellent communication and presentation abilities.\r\nProficiency in Microsoft Office (Excel, PowerPoint, Word).\r\nAbility to work independently and in a team environment.\r\nPrior experience in consulting or research is a plus but not required.', 'Hands-on experience in business consulting.\r\nOpportunity to work with experienced professionals.\r\nNetworking opportunities with industry leaders.\r\nPotential for future full-time employment.\r\nSalary Type: Negotiable\r\n\r\nJob Category: Consulting & Business Services\r\n\r\nCompany Details:\r\nUBI Consulting LLC\r\n📍 Address: 89 Nukus St, Tashkent, Tashkent Region 100015, UZ\r\n📞 Phone:  +998 71 2540022, 2546669,\r\n2552155, 2547774, 2559995\r\n🌐 Website: www.ubi.uz\r\n💰 Revenue: $7.8 million\r\n👥 Employees: 32\r\n🏢 Industry: Retail, Business Consulting, and Services\r\n	\r\nE-Mail: info@ubi.uz / www.ubi.uz\r\n\r\nCompetitors: Deloitte, PwC, EY, Accenture, Bain & Company, McKinsey & Company, Oliver Wyman, KPMG, BCG, and more.\r\n\r\nThis structured approach ensures the job post is professional and informative!\r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" www.ubi.uz \" target=\"_blank\"> UBI Consulting LLC </a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.linkedin.com/company/ubi-consulting-llc-?trk=biz-companies-cym \" target=\"_blank\"> UBI LinkedIn</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-26 19:33:50', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-02-26 19:31:21', '2025-02-26 19:33:33'),
(35, 'Sales Marketing', 'UzAuto Motors', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'Uzavtosanoat Joint-Stock Company invites undergraduate and graduate students, as well as young professionals, to participate in a paid internship program across various company divisions, including the head office.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity for young specialists to start a career in a leading automotive company, gain valuable experience, and apply their academic knowledge in practice.\r\n\r\nSelected interns will join one of the following divisions:\r\n\r\nMarketing and Sales\r\nInvestment Attraction\r\nFinance\r\nEngineering & Project Management', 'upl/logo/1740600947_349f3d62c9f3e88727b97507991a7fe3.jpg', 'Assist in research and analysis in assigned departments. Support company projects and contribute to strategic planning. Collaborate with professionals to gain hands-on experience. Participate in business meetings and training sessions. Work on cross-functional tasks to enhance professional growth.', 'Proficiency in English, Russian, and Uzbek.\r\nBachelor\'s or Master\'s degree (or currently enrolled).\r\nStrong knowledge of MS Office.\r\nAbility to successfully pass company tests and interviews.\r\nExperience in the automotive industry or knowledge of vehicle design is a plus.\r\nStrong analytical and financial understanding.\r\nExcellent communication skills and ability to multitask.', 'Full-time work schedule with possible business trips.\r\nCompetitive salary and performance-based bonuses.\r\nEmployment in accordance with the Labor Code of the Republic of Uzbekistan.\r\nOpportunity to gain industry experience and professional mentorship.\r\n📩 Interested candidates should send their CV with a photo and contact details to hr@uzavtosanoat.uz with the hashtag #IWantToWorkInUzAvto.\r\n\r\n“O’zavtosanoat” AJ rasmiy kanali | Официальный канал АО \"Узавтосаноат\"\r\n\"O\'zbekiston Respublikasi, Toshkent shahri, Mirobod tumani, Amir Temur ko\'chasi, 13\r\n+998 (78) 141-77-77\r\nIshonch telefoni raqami: +998 (78) 140-76-66\r\nE-mail: info@uzavtosanoat.uz\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://t.me/uzauto_official\" target=\"_blank\"> UzAuto Official Telegram </a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.instagram.com/uzavtosanoat/\" target=\"_blank\"> UzAuto Instagram</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-26 20:17:23', 1, 0, 3, 6, '2025-02-26 20:14:23', '2025-02-26 20:17:23'),
(36, 'QA Internship', 'Click', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'Click, a leading fintech company, is launching a paid QA Internship program for 4th-year students and junior IT specialists interested in a career in software testing. This is a unique opportunity to gain real-world experience in IT, work on Click\'s projects, and receive mentorship from industry experts.\r\n\r\nClick – ведущая финтех-компания, запускает оплачиваемую стажировку QA для студентов 4-го курса и начинающих IT-специалистов, мечтающих о карьере в тестировании. Это уникальная возможность получить практический опыт, работать над реальными проектами Click и учиться у экспертов отрасли.', 'upl/logo/1740601885_Без названия.png', 'Participate in testing real fintech projects within Click.  Learn and apply QA methodologies to ensure software quality.  Identify, document, and report software issues.  Collaborate with development and testing teams.  Engage in manual and automated testing activities.  Участие в тестировании реальных финтех-проектов Click.  Изучение и применение методологий QA для обеспечения качества программного обеспечения.  Обнаружение, документирование и отчетность о проблемах в ПО.  Взаимодействие с командами разработки и тестирования.  Участие в ручном и автоматизированном тестировании.', '4th-year student or a recent IT graduate.\r\n\r\nBasic understanding of QA testing principles.\r\n\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills.\r\n\r\nProficiency in English, Russian, and Uzbek.\r\n\r\nKnowledge of MS Office and testing tools is an advantage.\r\n\r\nAbility to multitask and work efficiently.\r\n\r\nСтудент 4-го курса или недавний выпускник IT-направления.\r\n\r\nБазовое понимание принципов тестирования QA.\r\n\r\nСильные аналитические и решающие способности.\r\n\r\nВладение английским, русским и узбекским языками.\r\n\r\nЗнание MS Office и инструментов тестирования приветствуется.\r\n\r\nУмение работать в многозадачном режиме.', 'aid 3-month internship with real project experience.\r\n\r\nTraining and mentorship from experienced QA specialists.\r\n\r\nOpportunity to receive a full-time job offer after successful completion.\r\n\r\nWork in an innovative fintech environment.\r\n\r\nОплачиваемая 3-месячная стажировка с участием в реальных проектах.\r\n\r\nОбучение и наставничество от опытных QA-специалистов.\r\n\r\nВозможность получить постоянное трудоустройство по итогам стажировки.\r\n\r\nРабота в инновационной финтех-среде.\r\n\r\nSelection Process / Этапы отбора:\r\n1️⃣ Apply online / Подача заявки (Application Link / Ссылка) with your resume and motivation letter.\r\n2️⃣ On-site testing / Очное тестирование at Click’s office.\r\n3️⃣ Technical interviews / Технические интервью with finalists.\r\n4️⃣ Internship start / Начало стажировки for selected candidates.\r\n\r\n📅 Application Deadline / Дедлайн подачи заявок: February 28, 2025 / 28 февраля 2025\r\n\r\n📩 Interested candidates should apply and join our Click Students Telegram Channel for updates! 🚀\r\n📩 Заинтересованные кандидаты могут подать заявку и подписаться на наш Telegram-канал Click Students для новостей!\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/internship_qa\" target=\"_blank\"> Application Link / Ссылка </a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://t.me/click_students” target=\"_blank\"> Click Students Telegram Channel</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-26 20:31:45', 1, 0, 5, 6, '2025-02-26 20:29:45', '2025-02-26 20:31:25'),
(37, 'Procurement Intern / Стажёр в отдел Закупок', 'Beeline Uzbekistan', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'Beeline Uzbekistan is looking for young talents!\r\n\r\nWe are excited to announce the recruitment of young specialists for our Procurement Department. If you are ambitious, eager to learn, and ready to grow, this opportunity is for you!\r\n\r\nКомпания Beeline Uzbekistan в поиске молодых талантов!\r\n\r\nМы рады объявить о начале набора молодых специалистов в отдел Закупок. Если ты амбициозен, готов учиться и развиваться, эта возможность именно для тебя!', 'upl/logo/1740602842_Beeline-Uzbekistan-1200px-logo.png', 'Assist in procurement processes and supplier interactions.  Support the team in handling real business tasks and projects.  Conduct market research and analysis.  Prepare reports and presentations.  Collaborate with different departments to optimize procurement operations.  Участие в процессах закупок и взаимодействие с поставщиками.  Поддержка команды в реальных бизнес-задачах и проектах.  Проведение анализа рынка и исследований.  Подготовка отчетов и презентаций.  Взаимодействие с различными отделами для оптимизации закупочных процессов.', '✔ Final-year student or recent graduate.\r\n✔ Fluent in English, Turkish is a plus.\r\n✔ Proficient in MS Excel and PowerPoint.\r\n✔ Strong teamwork and communication skills.\r\n\r\n✔ Студент последних курсов или недавний выпускник.\r\n✔ Свободное владение английским языком, знание турецкого – плюс.\r\n✔ Опытный пользователь MS Excel и PowerPoint.\r\n✔ Развитые навыки командной работы и коммуникации.', '✅ Hands-on experience in real business tasks and projects.\r\n✅ Personal mentor for guidance.\r\n✅ Flexible work schedule.\r\n✅ Opportunity to start a career in one of Uzbekistan’s leading companies.\r\n\r\n✅ Практический опыт в реальных бизнес-задачах и проектах.\r\n✅ Индивидуальный наставник для поддержки.\r\n✅ Гибкий график работы.\r\n✅ Шанс начать карьеру в одной из ведущих компаний Узбекистана.\r\nReady to join our team? Send your resume and motivation letter (“Why I want to work at Beeline Uzbekistan”) to graduate@beeline.uz\r\n\r\nГотов стать частью нашей команды? Отправь свое резюме и мотивационное письмо («Почему я хочу работать в Beeline Uzbekistan») на почту: graduate@beeline.uz\r\n\r\n🗓 Application deadline / Дедлайн подачи заявок: February 28, 2025 / 28 февраля 2025 года\r\n\r\nBeeline Uzbekistan – your career starts here! / Beeline Uzbekistan — старт твоей карьеры! \r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://beeline.uz/ru/job-vacancy/kompaniya-beeline-uzbekistan-v-poiske-molodyh-talantov\" target=\"_blank\"> Official Website Link for application </a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-26 21:09:35', 1, 0, 3, 6, '2025-02-26 20:44:50', '2025-02-26 21:09:35'),
(38, 'Intern – Audit Department / Стажёр в отделе аудита', 'Ernst & Young (EY)', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'We are looking for an Audit Intern!\r\nErnst & Young (EY) is a professional services network that offers accounting, tax, and business advisory services. It\'s one of the world\'s largest professional services networks and is considered one of the Big Four accounting firms. \r\n\r\nAre you eager to start your career in auditing and professional services? Our Audit Department Internship is a great opportunity for students and recent graduates to gain hands-on experience working with top-tier companies and industry experts.\r\n\r\nМы ищем стажёра в отдел аудита!\r\n\r\nХотите начать карьеру в аудите и профессиональных услугах? Наша стажировка в отделе аудита – отличная возможность для студентов и выпускников получить практический опыт, работая с ведущими компаниями и экспертами отрасли.', 'upl/logo/1740603538_images (1).png', 'Assist in audit engagements and financial analysis.  Conduct data analysis and report preparation.  Support teams in documenting and verifying financial records.  Learn and apply audit methodologies and procedures.  Participate in team discussions and client interactions.  Участие в аудиторских проверках и финансовом анализе.  Проведение анализа данных и подготовка отчетов.  Поддержка команд в документировании и проверке финансовых записей.  Изучение и применение методов и процедур аудита.  Участие в командных обсуждениях и взаимодействие с клиентами.', '✔ Final-year student or recent graduate in Finance, Accounting, or related fields.\r\n✔ Fluent in English (written and verbal).\r\n✔ Proficiency in MS Office (Excel, Word, PowerPoint).\r\n✔ Strong analytical skills and attention to detail.\r\n✔ High motivation and enthusiasm to start a career in auditing.\r\n\r\n✔ Студент последнего курса или выпускник (финансы, бухгалтерский учет или смежные направления).\r\n✔ Свободное владение английским языком (письменно и устно).\r\n✔ Опыт работы с MS Office (Excel, Word, PowerPoint).\r\n✔ Сильные аналитические навыки и внимательность к деталям.\r\n✔ Высокая мотивация и желание начать карьеру в аудите.', '✅ Work with a bright, friendly, and energetic team.\r\n✅ Develop your personal and business skills.\r\n✅ Gain experience by working on challenging projects.\r\n✅ Learn from top professionals in the industry.\r\n\r\n✅ Работа в дружной, энергичной и профессиональной команде.\r\n✅ Развитие личных и профессиональных навыков.\r\n✅ Участие в интересных и сложных проектах.\r\n✅ Обучение у ведущих экспертов отрасли.\r\n\r\n📩 Ready to apply? Send your CV to oftobkhon.akhadjonova@uz.ey.com\r\n\r\n📩 Готовы подать заявку? Отправьте своё резюме на oftobkhon.akhadjonova@uz.ey.com\r\n\r\n🚀 Kickstart your career in auditing today! / Начни свою карьеру в аудите уже сегодня! 🚀\r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.instagram.com/eycentralasiacareers/p/C3CEodmIT_Q/\" target=\"_blank\"> Official E&Y Instagram </a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-02-26 21:06:31', 1, 0, 11, 6, '2025-02-26 20:56:48', '2025-02-26 21:06:31'),
(39, 'Administrator / Администратор', 'NEW WORLD LLC', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Mebel markazi mehmonlarini kutib olish va maslahat berish / Встреча и консультирование гостей мебельного центра\r\nTashrif buyuruvchilarga do‘konlar, xizmatlar va aksiyalar haqida ma’lumot berish / Информирование посетителей о магазинах, услугах и акциях центра\r\nMijozlar oqimini boshqarish, yo‘naltirish / Координация потока клиентов, помощь в навигации\r\nKelayotgan qo‘ng‘iroqlar bilan ishlash / Работа с входящими звонками', 'upl/logo/1740675319_Purple And White Bold Career Fair Instagram Post.png', 'Mijozlarni qabul qilish / Прием посетителей Mijozlar bilan ishlash / Работа с клиентами Konsultativ savdolar / Консультативные продажи Mijozga yo‘naltirilgan xizmat / Клиентоориентированность Mijozlarni kuzatib borish / Сопровождение клиентов Savodli og‘zaki nutq / Грамотная устная речь Mijozlarni konsultatsiya qilish / Консультирование клиентов Mas\'uliyatlilik / Ответственность O‘qimishlilik / Обучаемость', 'Rus va o‘zbek tillarini bilish (kamida B1 daraja) / Знания русского и узбекского языков (минимум уровень B1)\r\nDo‘stona muomala, kommunikativlik, ozoda tashqi ko‘rinish / Доброжелательность, коммуникабельность, опрятный внешний вид\r\nMas’uliyatlilik, aniqlik, stressga bardoshlilik / Ответственность, пунктуальность, стрессоустойчивость', 'Barqaror maosh to‘lovlari / Стабильные выплаты\r\nZamonaviy mebel markazida qulay ish joyi / Комфортное рабочее место в современном мебельном центре\r\nDo‘stona jamoa va sodiq rahbariyat / Дружелюбный коллектив и лояльное руководство\r\nSalary Type / Тип оплаты:\r\nFixed salary (5 000 000 – 9 000 000 so‘m oyiga, qo‘lga) / Фиксированная зарплата (5 000 000 – 9 000 000 сум в месяц, на руки)\r\n\r\nPayment Frequency / Выплаты: Two times a month (Oyiga ikki marta) / Два раза в месяц\r\n\r\nContact: Акбарова С\r\n+998 (90) 9229013, Отвечаю с 10:00 до 20:00\r\nemail: sarvinozakbarova1908@gmail.com\r\n\r\n<p> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> </p> <p>✉️ <a href=\"mailto: sarvinozakbarova1908@gmail.com \"> sarvinozakbarova1908@gmail.com </a></p>', '500', '2025-02-27 16:58:39', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-02-27 16:46:28', '2025-02-27 16:58:39'),
(40, 'Менеджер магазина / Do‘kon menejeri', 'Korzinka (Anglesey food)', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Korzinka — ведущий розничный ритейлер Узбекистана с более чем 150+ магазинами в 11 регионах, среди которых супермаркеты Korzinka, Korzinka Mahalla, Smart, Korzinka Biznes и онлайн-сервис Korzinka Go. Наша команда состоит из профессионалов с образованием из ведущих мировых университетов, а также с опытом работы в крупных компаниях, таких как Big Four, Leroy Merlin, МВидео, Эльдорадо, X5 Group, Yandex и Avito. Сейчас эту вакансию смотрят 9 человек.\r\n/\r\nKorzinka – O‘zbekistonning yetakchi chakana savdo tarmog‘i bo‘lib, 11 ta hududda 150+ dan ortiq do‘konga ega (Korzinka supermarketlari, Korzinka Mahalla, Smart, Korzinka Biznes va Korzinka Go onlayn-xizmati). Bizning jamoamiz dunyoning yetakchi universitetlarida tahsil olgan va Big Four, Leroy Merlin, M.Video, Eldorado, X5 Group, Yandex, Avito kabi yirik kompaniyalarda tajriba orttirgan mutaxassislardan iborat. Hozirda ushbu vakansiyani 9 kishi ko‘rib chiqmoqda.', 'upl/logo/1740678196_article-original.jpg', 'Управление магазином, достижение ключевых показателей бизнеса; Руководство персоналом, повышение квалификации и контроль показателей; Организация эффективного функционирования всех процессов магазина; Контроль соблюдения стандартов обслуживания клиентов; Разработка и проведение мероприятий по повышению качества торгового процесса и товарооборота; Взаимодействие с поставщиками, контроль приемки, возврата и списания товара; Обеспечение соблюдения правил торговли; Участие в инвентаризациях; Анализ отчетности и разработка планов для достижения показателей. / Do‘konni boshqarish, asosiy biznes ko‘rsatkichlariga erishish; Xodimlarni boshqarish, ularning malakasini oshirish va natijalarini nazorat qilish; Do‘konning barcha jarayonlarini samarali tashkil etish; Mijozlarga xizmat ko‘rsatish standartlariga rioya etilishini nazorat qilish; Savdo jarayonlari va tovar aylanmasini yaxshilash bo‘yicha tadbirlar ishlab chiqish va o‘tkazish; Yetkazib beruvchilar bilan ishlash, mahsulot qabul qilish, qaytarish va hisobdan chiqarishni nazorat qilish; Savdo qoidalariga rioya etilishini ta’minlash; Inventarizatsiyada ishtirok etish; Hisobotlarni tahlil qilish va ko‘rsatkichlarga erishish uchun reja tuzish', 'Высшее образование;\r\nОпыт управления командой;\r\nРазвитые лидерские качества, хорошие коммуникативные навыки, эмоциональная зрелость, организаторские способности;\r\nУверенный пользователь ПК;\r\nСвободное владение русским и узбекским языками.\r\n/\r\nOliy ma’lumot;\r\nJamoani boshqarish tajribasi;\r\nYetakchilik qobiliyatlari, yaxshi muloqot ko‘nikmalari, emosional yetuklik, tashkilotchilik qobiliyati;\r\nKompyuterdan mustaqil foydalana olish;\r\nRus va o‘zbek tillarini erkin bilish.', 'Устраиваем на работу без таниш-билиш;\r\nОформляем по трудовому кодексу;\r\nВыплачиваем зарплату вовремя;\r\nПредоставляем комплексное питание;\r\nОплачиваем контракт в ВУЗе.\r\n/\r\nIshga olishda tanish-bilish shart emas;\r\nMehnat qonunlariga muvofiq rasmiy rasmiylashtirish;\r\nMaoshni o‘z vaqtida to‘laymiz;\r\nTo‘liq taomnoma bilan ta’minlaymiz;\r\nOliy ta’lim kontraktini to‘lab beramiz.\r\nТип оплаты / Maosh turi:\r\nФиксированная зарплата: от 7 000 000 сум в месяц, на руки\r\n/\r\nQat’iy maosh: oyiga 7 000 000 so‘mdan, qo‘lga\r\n\r\nГрафик работы / Ish grafigi:\r\n6/1\r\n\r\nРабочие часы / Ish soatlari:\r\n8 часов в день / Kuniga 8 soat\r\n\r\nФормат работы / Ish formati:\r\nНа месте работодателя / Ish beruvchi joyida\r\n\r\nhttps://t.me/korzinka_jbot?start=utm_source=website\r\n\r\n<p> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/korzinka_jbot?start=utm_source=website\" target=\"_blank\"> Korzinka Official HR Bot Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://rabota.korzinka.uz/vacancies/\" target=\"_blank\">Korzinka Official Website Vacancies</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> <br>  📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> </p>', '7000000', '2025-02-27 17:44:13', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-02-27 17:33:22', '2025-02-27 17:44:13'),
(41, 'Менеджер по бронированию со знанием русского и узбекского языков', 'ООО Central Asia Travel', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', '- прием и обработка поступающих заявок\r\n- бронирование гостиниц, питания, услуг гидов и т.д.\r\n- прием телефонных звонков\r\n- деловая переписка с партнерами и клиентами\r\n- выполнение поручений руководства\r\n- отчетность о проделанной работе, согласно правилам, принятым в компании', 'upl/logo/1741040070_company-logo.png', '• Свободное владение как письменной, так и устной формой узбекского и русского языка – обязательно! • Уверенный пользователь ПК • Внимательность, оперативность и усидчивость. • Желателен опыт работы в сфере туризма на прием.', '- Постоянная работа, полный день, работа на территории работодателя\r\n- Работа в офисе в центре Ташкента\r\n- Полный рабочий день (5/2) с 09:00 до 18:00;\r\n- Заработная плата: без опыта работы от 4 млн\r\n- Испытательный срок: 0,5 месяца\r\n- После успешного прохождения испытательного срока возможно трудоустройство согласно ТК РУз.\r\n\r\nПожалуйста, высылайте резюме на e-mail.\r\n\r\nКонтакты: Самиров Миран            catravel@mail.ru\r\nmore details: https://tashkent.hh.uz/vacancy/111114122?hhtmFrom=vacancy_search_list', 'от 4 000 000 so\'m за месяц, на руки\r\nОпыт работы: не требуется\r\nПолная занятость\r\nГрафик: 5/2\r\nРабочие часы: 8\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://www.centralasia-travel.com/en/about/nashi-vakansii\" target=\"_blank\"> Apply Central Asia Travel via Official Website</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br>', '400', '2025-03-03 22:14:30', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-03 22:13:07', '2025-03-03 22:14:30'),
(42, 'Audit Summer Internship', 'KPMG', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'Join KPMG Audit team in Tashkent! \r\n\r\nWe\'re expanding our team and looking for talented individuals to kickstart their careers with us. Are you a senior student or graduate in accounting, finance, or economics with a knack for numbers? Look no further! Join our Tashkent Audit Team!', 'upl/logo/1741545625_kpmguzbekistan_logo.jpg', 'Job Responsibilities Verify financial statements for accuracy and reliability while providing crucial insights to clients. Analyze business operations and consult on financial rules and requirements. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to improve financial processes.', 'Senior student or graduate in accounting, finance, or economics.\r\nStrong analytical skills and attention to detail.\r\nProficiency in English and excellent communication skills.\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team.', 'Growth Opportunities: Develop your skills and advance your career.\r\nDynamic Environment: Collaborate with experienced professionals in the field.\r\nImpactful Work: Contribute to meaningful audits and make a difference.\r\nShould you have any questions, feel free to reach out to us at: personnel-uz@kpmg.com \r\n\r\nApply now via registration form below! Don\'t miss this stellar opportunity!\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/kpmgcareerca\" target=\"_blank\"> KPMG Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/uz/en/home/careers/graduate/vacancies.html\" target=\"_blank\">KPMG Official Website</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdMBNs95H-X5tpIkOpehGgXBbBfeqSoCoYkvgrpNao3roeZcw/viewform?pli=1\" target=\"_blank\">Fill out directly to KPMG</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://uz.linkedin.com/company/kpmguzbekistan\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-09 19:11:05', 1, 0, 11, 6, '2025-03-09 18:37:28', '2025-03-09 19:11:05'),
(43, 'Вожатые-координаторы', 'ProCamp', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Part-time', '😃 Летний лагерь ProCamp ищет самых ярких и креативных!\r\n\r\nВ нашу дружную команду требуются:\r\n\r\n🔹Вожатые-координаторы \r\n🔹Мобилографы\r\n🔹Диджей\r\n🔹Физрук-плаврук\r\n🔹Фотограф\r\n🔹Ассистенты - кружководы\r\n🔹Преподаватели различных языковых и профессиональных направлений.\r\n🔹Sales-Менеджер', 'upl/logo/1741546391_photo_2024-04-25_17-50-10.jpg', 'Требования к кандидатам:  🔸 Возраст от 18 лет  🔸 Креативность, ответственность и стрессоустойчивость 🔸 И естественно любовь к детям (без неё никак)  Если ты креативный, амбициозный и активный, то тебе точно к нам!😉', 'Если ты креативный, амбициозный и активный, то тебе точно к нам!😉', '<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/procampuz\" target=\"_blank\"> ProCamp Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/procamp.uz?igsh=Zmg0ZmNkNTdzZWc\" target=\"_blank\">ProCamp Instagram</a> <br> \r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> \r\n   </p>\r\n\r\n\r\nОставляй свою заявку в наш Телеграм! @procamp_hr\r\n\r\nНам нужен именно ты! 🫵', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-09 18:53:11', 1, 0, 7, 6, '2025-03-09 18:51:14', '2025-03-09 18:53:11');
