(44, 'Sales Manager', 'Route ELD', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Part-time', 'We invite sales managers to the logistics company \"Route ELD\"!', 'upl/logo/1741546809_photo_2025-03-09_23-55-24.jpg', 'The most important thing is that you have passion!', 'Requirements:\r\n- Any level of education (student, bachelor, etc.)\r\n- Has experience in the field of sales (if there is no experience, we will teach)\r\n- English language B2-C1 (can speak and write freely)\r\n- IELTS 7+ candidates are taken even without experience!', 'Our offers:\r\n- We pay higher wages than our competitors\r\nThat\'s $500 + KPI (ie you get your profit from your sales)!\r\n- Professional training fees by field\r\n- Collective Teambuildings\r\n- Modern office in the city center\r\n- Career building (head of department level and other projects)\r\n- Dining and sports facilities \r\n- You can work REMOTE OR AFTER STUDIES\r\n\r\nContact:\r\n@jbrooks_19\r\nWe look forward to seeing you all!\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n                📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> \r\n   </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-09 19:09:35', 1, 0, 3, 6, '2025-03-09 18:59:01', '2025-03-09 19:09:35'),
(45, 'Cтажировку в программе 1С:Бухгалтерия', 'Venkon Group', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'Дорогие студенты🎓, хотим сообщить, что компания Venkon Group🏛 предлагает для студентов бесплатную стажировку в программе 1С:Бухгалтерия💻\r\n\r\nКомпания Venkon Group 💼 является экспертом в области информационных технологий и занимает 70% доли рынка в автоматизации бизнеса в Узбекистане. Компания предоставляет широкий спектр услуг бизнесам.', 'upl/logo/1741547284_photo_2025-03-06_10-33-55.jpg', 'Помощь в анализе и оптимизации бизнес-процессов с использованием решений 1С. Поддержка клиентов по техническим вопросам и консультирование по использованию программы 1С.', 'Студент 1–4 курса по специальностям в области бухгалтерии, финансов или информационных технологий.', 'Преимущества:\r\n-доступно для студентов 1-4 курсов\r\n-стажировка проводится в онлайн формате на русском языке\r\n-выдается сертификат после прохождения экзамена\r\n-выплачивается денежное вознаграждение при получении сертификата\r\n-трудоустройство лучших стажеров\r\n\r\nВсе начинается с маленького шага! Воспользуйтесь возможностью! \r\n\r\nЗаинтересованные студенты обращайтесь\r\n📱 @pdc_mdistashkent  📥careercentre@mdist.uz\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n                📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> \r\n   </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-09 19:08:04', 1, 0, 11, 6, '2025-03-09 19:06:56', '2025-03-09 19:08:04'),
(46, 'Офис-менеджер', 'C-Space', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'ООО C-Space 👉 hh.uz (https://tashkent.hh.uz/vacancy/118023882?hhtmFrom=vacancy_search_list) \r\n\r\nОфис-менеджер\r\nот 3 000 000 до 5 000 000 so\'m за месяц, на руки\r\nОпыт работы: не требуется\r\nПолная занятость\r\nГрафик: 5/2\r\nРабочие часы: 8', 'upl/logo/1741547899_L_height.webp', 'Все обязанности объясняются при собеседовании.', '-владение языком: русский и узбекский язык на уровне С1, английский B1;\r\n\r\n-опыт работы необязательно, мы сами всему обучим;\r\n\r\n-знание ПК (работы с программами Excel, Word и тд);\r\n\r\n-общительность;\r\n\r\n-презентабельность;\r\n\r\n-ответственность, пунктуальность и честность', 'Условия:\r\n\r\n-карьерный рост;\r\n\r\n-молодой и дружный коллектив;\r\n\r\n-комфортное место работы;\r\n\r\n-стабильная заработная плата;\r\n\r\n-график с 09:00 до 18:00\r\n\r\n-бесплатное доступ ко всему коворкингу;\r\n\r\n-бесплатный тренажёрный зал.\r\n\r\nКонтакты: Rukhshona +998 (91) 487 58 18\r\n\r\ninfo@cspace.uz\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', '300', '2025-03-09 19:18:19', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-09 19:16:28', '2025-03-09 19:18:19'),
(47, 'Reception', 'Oʻzbekiston Milliy Banki', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'O\'zmilliybank” AJ Toshkent viloyati  Bosh boshqarmasi qoshidagi Oydin BXOga (Olmaliq shahriga) ishga taklif etadi!\r\n\r\nResepshn bo’yicha mutaxassis\r\n\r\nS\r\n📩Отправить резюме (https://hmsg.me/u0195043a-376c-7055-9b5a-157b5025088forganic)\r\n\r\nAKTUAL VAKANSIYALAR (https://hmsg.me/u01921e44-fcf7-739d-9e5b-8678e66236b4)\r\nIG | (https://www.instagram.com/nbu_career?igsh=MWFkYXQ1cnh4Zzdxbw%3D%3D&utm_source=qr) FB | (https://www.facebook.com/people/NBUHR/61561481422669/) LinkedIn | (https://www.linkedin.com/company/national-bankof-uzbekistan/) Web (https://nbu.uz/uz/vacancies/?tpclid=facebook.PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAAaav0qUU16fES4QLq6sJlH8U1dMU1Dq_cbG0-Fap4Jx1JCNIKUJfsMpZYtU_aem_z5BpSINit5mnsKaT1iRf7Q)', 'upl/logo/1741552268_images (2).png', 'izning vazifalaringiz quyidagilardan iborat bo\'ladi:   🔹 Mijozlarni qabul qilish, xodimlar ishini nazorat qilish va ular bilan ishonchli munosabatlarni o\'rnatish, mehnat intizomini ta\'rtibga solish, ichki tartib qoidalariga rioya qilish va mulk xavfsizligini ta\'minlash.   📩Rezyumeni jonatish (https://hmsg.me/u0195043a-376c-7055-9b5a-157b5025088forganic)  ———  🏦АО «Узнацбанк» приглашает на работу в ОБУ Ойдин(г. Алмалык) при Главном управление Ташкентской области   Специалист по ресепшн  Вашими задачами будут:  🔹 Приём клиентов, установление доверительных отношений и контроль работы сотрудников, обеспечение трудовой дисциплины, соблюдение внутренних правил и сохранности имущества.', 'A’lo darajadagi muloqot va insonlar bilan ishlash ko‘nikmalari.\r\nMijozlar va xodimlar bilan ishonchli munosabatlarni o‘rnatish qobiliyati.\r\nMuammolarni hal qilish va nizolarni boshqarish ko‘nikmalari.\r\nTashkiliy va vaqtni boshqarish ko‘nikmalari yuqori darajada.', '<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://hmsg.me/u0195043a-376c-7055-9b5a-157b5025088forganic\" target=\"_blank\"> Rezyumeni jonatish </a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nbu_career?igsh=MWFkYXQ1cnh4Zzdxbw%3D%3D&utm_source=qr\" target=\"_blank\">Milliy Bank Official Website</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://api.hrmessenger.com/projects/vacancy?mode=u&uuid=01921e44-fcf7-739d-9e5b-8678e66236b4&a=1\" target=\"_blank\">Milly Bank Aktual Vakansiyalar</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-09 20:31:08', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-09 20:28:50', '2025-03-09 20:31:08'),
(48, 'Менеджер по продажам в онлайн школу', 'ООО LEADER ONLINE', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'ООО LEADER ONLINE \r\n\r\nМенеджер по продажам в онлайн школу\r\nот 7 000 000 до 35 000 000 so\'m за месяц, на руки\r\nВыплаты: раз в месяц\r\nОпыт работы: не требуется\r\nПолная занятость\r\nГрафик: 5/2\r\nРабочие часы: 9', 'upl/logo/1741553514_Без названия (1).jpg', 'Готовы рассмотреть твою кандидатуру, если:  - ты коммуникабелен;  - свободно владеешь узбекским и русским языками;  - ты знаком с CRM-системой или готов быстро освоить.', 'Если ты просматриваешь объявления на этом портале, ты\r\n\r\n- либо только начинаешь работать после ВУЗа,\r\n\r\n- либо твоя карьера в продажах уже не задалась.\r\n\r\nМы готовы тебя научить/переучить и вывести на новый уровень в самой востребованной сфере, если ты готов сделать усилие над собой.', 'Мы предлагаем тебе:\r\n\r\n- международную команду и офис в центре Ташкента;\r\n\r\n- качественное обучение и оплачиваемую стажировку;\r\n\r\n- большие бонусы и стремительный карьерный рост.\r\n\r\nОставляй отклик на вакансию, покажи себя на собеседовании и стартуй свой карьерный путь в Leader online!\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://tashkent.hh.uz/vacancy/117770751?hhtmFromLabel=suitable_vacancies&hhtmFrom=vacancy\" target=\"_blank\"> Oline topshirish </a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', '7000000', '2025-03-09 20:51:54', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-09 20:45:53', '2025-03-09 20:51:54'),
(49, 'Internship at EPAM Uzbekistan', 'EPAM Uzbekistan', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'EPAM, a leading digital transformation services and product engineering company, continues to provide online free training and internship opportunities.\r\n\r\n💻 Training programs:\r\n<p>\r\n    EPAM, a leading digital transformation services and product engineering company, continues to provide online free training and internship opportunities.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    💻 <strong>Training programs:</strong> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-java-u~\" target=\"_blank\">Java Web Development</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-sft-u~\" target=\"_blank\">Software Functional Testing</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-at-net-u~\" target=\"_blank\">Automated Testing in .NET</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-at-java-u~\" target=\"_blank\">Automated Testing in Java</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-at-js-u~\" target=\"_blank\">Automated Testing in JavaScript</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-cloud-u1\" target=\"_blank\">Cloud & DevOps</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-sft-u\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to Functional Testing</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-java-u\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to Java</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-python-u~\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to Python</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-cloud-u2\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to Cloud & DevOps</a> <br>\r\n</p>', 'upl/logo/1741607831_4b8af8.jpg', 'Being able to join online with passion', '<p>\r\n    🎯 <strong>Internships:</strong> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-sft-uk\" target=\"_blank\">Software Functional Testing Internship</a> <br>\r\n    📱 <a href=\"https://epa.ms/uz-cloud-u3\" target=\"_blank\">Cloud & DevOps Internship</a> <br>\r\n</p>', 'Gain market oriented hard & soft skills alongside tech professionals and seize the chance to join the EPAM team.\r\n\r\nEPAM Campus Blog (https://campus.epam.uz/en/blog?utm_source=outlook&utm_medium=campus-digest&utm_campaign=ta&utm_content=uz-blog)  /  Career Test (https://campus.epam.uz/en/career-test/guidance?utm_source=outlook&utm_medium=campus-digest&utm_campaign=ta&utm_content=uz-career-test)  /  Navigation Test (https://campus.epam.uz/en/career-journey)  /  Telegram Channel (https://t.me/epamtrainingcenter)\r\n\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n         📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-10 12:00:48', 1, 0, 5, 6, '2025-03-10 11:55:42', '2025-03-10 12:00:48'),
(50, 'Менеджер сотовой компании в call-центр', 'ООО CALLTECH', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'ООО CALLTECH \r\nМенеджер сотовой компании в call-центр\r\nот 4 500 000 до 5 500 000 so\'m за месяц, до вычета налогов\r\nОпыт работы: не требуется\r\nПолная занятость\r\nГрафик: 2/2\r\nРабочие часы: 9, 10, 11 или 12\r\n\r\nНаша компания — это более чем просто контактный центр. Мы — динамичный аутсорсинговый игрок на международной арене с 2009 года, обслуживающий более 400 партнеров. Благодаря высококвалифицированной команде из 2000 сотрудников, мы создаем инновационные решения, которые способствуют повышению эффективности бизнеса наших клиентов.', 'upl/logo/1741608871_images (3).png', 'Требования:  Знание русского языка в совершенстве;  Знание ПК на уровне пользователя;  Желание расти и развиваться;', 'Обязанности:\r\n\r\nРабота с действующими клиентами крупнейшего провайдера;\r\n\r\nИнформирование о новых тарифах в формате выгод и преимуществ;\r\n\r\nПроверка технических требований для подключения домашнего интернета.\r\n\r\nОставляйте отклик и мы подберем для тебя подходящее направление.\r\n\r\nКонтакты: Абдухакимова Нозима +998 (78) 113 18 34 \r\n\r\nnabduhakimova_t1@contact-cntr.ru', 'Предлагаем:\r\n\r\nдостойную заработную плату от 4 500 000 sum уже в первый месяц;\r\n\r\nОфициальное трудоустройство с выплатами заработной платы 2 раза в месяц;\r\n\r\nудобный график: 2/2 10-22, 11-23, 13-01, 14-02, 15-03, 17-05, 9-07, 21-09;\r\n\r\nоплачиваемые перерывы (время отдыха и обеда);\r\n\r\nпрофессиональное обучение с выдачей электронного сертификата о пройденном курсе и приобретенных навыков;\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n       📱 <a href=\" https://tashkent.hh.uz/vacancy/117971328?hhtmFromLabel=suitable_vacancies&hhtmFrom=vacancy\r\n\" target=\"_blank\"> Apply here</a> <br>\r\n         📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', '5500000', '2025-03-10 12:18:48', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-10 12:12:57', '2025-03-10 12:18:48'),
(51, 'Оператор контактного центра, г. Ташкент', 'Ucell', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Уровень дохода не указан\r\nОпыт работы: не требуется\r\n\r\nПолная занятость\r\nГрафик: 5/2\r\n\r\nРабочие часы: 8', 'upl/logo/1741610117_images (4).png', 'Обязанности: Предоставление информации клиентам в условиях подключения к сети, обеспечения сети, предоставления услуг и тарифов компании; Информирование клиентов о предоставлении услуг, о состоянии лицевого счета, включении в них услуг и предоставлении другой информации, необходимой ему в рамках договора на предоставление услуг сотовой радиотелефонной связи; Принятие заявок по жалобам клиентов и направление их соответствующим подразделениям; Осуществление в соответствии с установленным порядком действий по предотвращению возможного мошенничества со стороны клиентов.', 'Требования:\r\nОбразование высшее или среднее-специальное;\r\nУверенный пользователь MS Office;\r\nВладение русским и узбекским языками.', 'Условия:\r\nКультуру Компании, нацеленную на достижения результата;\r\nРабочую среду в команде профессионалов;\r\nДобровольное медицинское страхование (ДМС);\r\nКорпоративную сотовую связь;\r\nПрофессиональный рост и развитие.\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n         📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-10 12:35:17', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-10 12:33:31', '2025-03-10 12:35:17'),
(52, 'Onboarding mutaxassis', 'Najot Ta\'lim', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Ish vaqti: Full time\r\nOylik maoshi:  4 mln so\'mdan 8 mln so\'mgacha (tajribangizga ko\'ra maosh kelishiladi)', 'upl/logo/1741611964_62bf0db449f9250ea110c13b_Najot ta\'lim.jpg', 'Majburiyatlar: - Yangi kelgan xodimlar uchun onboarding dasturlarini ishlab chiqish va o‘tkazish; - Menejerlar va barcha xodimlar uchun o‘quv dasturlarini rejalashtirish va yaratish; - HR va O‘quv bo‘limlari bilan hamkorlikda xodimlarning rivojlantirish ehtiyojlarini aniqlash va amaliy dasturlarni ishlab chiqish; - Xodimlarning asosiy jihatlarini (soft skills, liderlik, texnik bilimlar) rivojlantirish bo‘yicha maxsus dasturlarni ishlab chiqish; - Trening materiallari va o‘quv qo‘llanmalarni ishlab chiqish, innovatsion va interaktiv yondashuvlarni joriy qilish.', 'Talablar:\r\n- HR sohasida kamida 1 yil ish tajribasi;\r\n- Faol treninglar o‘tkazish va samarador rivojlantirish usullariga ega bo‘lish;\r\n- LMS, Clickup yoki boshqa o‘quv va boshqaruv platformalarida ishlash tajribasi;\r\n- Shaxsiy fazilatlar: kommunikativlik, strategik fikrlash, ijodiy yondashuv va tashkiliy qobiliyat.', 'Takliflar:\r\n- Professional rivojlanish va o‘quv imkoniyatlari;\r\n- Do‘stona va ijodiy ish muhitida ishlash;\r\n- Qiziqarli va mas’uliyatli loyihalarda ishtirok etish imkoniyati;\r\n- Shaxsiy va kasbiy rivojlanish uchun qulay imkoniyatlar;\r\n- Jamoa a\'zolari bilan O\'zbekiston bo\'ylab sayohat va \"team building\"lar;\r\n- Samaradorlikka ko\'ra lavozim ko\'tarilishi va oylik maoshning oshishi.\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n       📱 <a href=\"https://nthr.bitrix24site.ru/onboarding/?utm_source=Telegram&utm_medium\" target=\"_blank\"> Ariza topshirish uchun havola </a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://yandex.uz/maps/org/najot_ta_lim/94800077397/?ll=69.203532%2C41.285835&z=16\" target=\"_blank\"> Manzil </a> <br>\r\n         📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', '8000000', '2025-03-10 13:08:02', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-10 13:04:00', '2025-03-10 13:08:02'),
(53, 'Торговый агент в компанию Krember', 'Krember', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'от 4 000 000 до 8 000 000 so\'m за месяц, на руки\r\nВыплаты: раз в месяц\r\n\r\nОпыт работы: 1–3 года\r\n\r\nПолная занятость\r\nГрафик: 6/1\r\n\r\nРабочие часы: 9\r\nФормат работы: на месте работодателя', 'upl/logo/1741637263_images (1).jpg', 'Посещать торговые точки (магазины) и принимать заказы на продукцию Krember', 'Требования:\r\nОпыт работы от 6 месяцев (если кандидат сильный, готовы обучить)\r\nНаличие смартфона обязательно', 'На дальние или слишком большие маршруты компания предоставляет автомобиль с водителем\r\nДоступно соискателям с инвалидностью\r\nAhmadov Dilmurod\r\n+998 (94) 4555652, Telegram: @savdoxodimi_krember\r\n\r\ndilmurodwellwin@gmail.com\r\n    <p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/brightbridge_uz\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/savdoxodimi_Krember \" target=\"_blank\"> Krember Telegram </a> <br>\r\n         📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', '8000000', '2025-03-10 20:11:26', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-10 20:06:11', '2025-03-10 20:11:26'),
(54, 'BMB HOLDING в активном поиске моделей', 'BMB HOLDING', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'О компании: BMB HOLDING была основана 4 апреля 2017 года. Наша компания предоставляет консультационные услуги по инвестиционным проектам, а также занимается экспортом и импортом, производством и выращиванием, глубокой переработкой и другими направлениями. Сегодня в состав компании входят 31 предприятие, из которых 5 являются совместными, а остальные — дочерними.\r\nМы ищем двух моделей для участия в проекте:', 'upl/logo/1741709592_photo_2025-03-11_21-12-36.jpg', 'Требования: Возраст: 18-30 лет Рост: высокий (от 165 см) Языки: свободное владение английским, русским и узбекским языками Образование: высшее Качества: коммуникабельность, уверенность в себе, ответственность', 'Условия:\r\nЗаработная плата по договоренности\r\nГибкий график работы\r\nУчастие в съемках, фотосессиях, рекламных проектах\r\nЕсли ты заинтересована, отправь свое резюме на @pdc_mdistashkent.', 'Присоединяйся к команде BMB HOLDING и стань частью успешного бизнеса!\r\n<p>\r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n        📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br>\r\n        📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a>\r\n    </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-11 16:13:12', 1, 0, 2, 6, '2025-03-11 16:11:32', '2025-03-11 16:13:12'),
(55, 'Sotuv Menejeri (Sales Manager) – Faqat qizlar uchun (Only for females)', 'BRIGHTBRIDGE LLC', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Location: Xalqlar do’stligi metro yonida\r\n\r\nJob Type: Offline (11:00 dan 18:00 gacha)\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nCLEANSING Kosmetologiya kompaniyasiga sotuv menejeri kerak. Sotuv menejeri kompaniya mahsulotlarini kosmetologlarga tanishtiradi va sotadi.', 'upl/logo/1739779310_vvvvvv.jpg', 'Maxsulotimizni kosmetologlarga tanishtirish va sotish Mijozlar bilan bog‘lanish va ularga maslahat berish Sotish maqsadlarini bajarish', 'Ravon nutq\r\nO‘ziga qarab yuradigan bo‘lishi\r\nGigiyena qoidalariga rioya qilish', 'Yakshanba dam olish kuni\r\nQulay lokatsiya\r\nYo‘l haqi alohida beriladi\r\nSotuv bo‘limi rahbariga ko‘tarilish imkoniyati\r\nSalary Type: Fixed Salary\r\nSalary: 6,000,000 – 14,000,000 UZS\r\n\r\nContact:\r\n@shuxratovna2108\r\n+998 91 787 69 68 (O‘zingiz haqingizda to‘liq ma’lumot va rasm yuboring – faqat 2 ta bo‘sh ish o‘rni bor)\r\n\r\n <p> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a> </p>', '14 000 000', '2025-03-20 05:20:24', 1, 0, 3, 6, '2025-03-20 05:19:56', '2025-03-20 05:19:56'),
(56, 'Haydovchi (Driver)', 'TAXI MILLENNIUM', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Location: Yunusobod, Sebzor\r\n\r\nJob Type: Full-time (Dushanbadan – Shanbagacha, 10:00 dan 18:00 gacha)\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nTAXI MILLENNIUM kompaniyasiga haydovchi kerak. Kompaniya mijozlar bazasi katta bo‘lib, haydovchilar uchun qulay ish sharoitlari taqdim etiladi.', 'upl/logo/1742448511_unnamed.png', 'Mijozlarni belgilangan manzilga xavfsiz yetkazish Kompaniya qoidalariga rioya qilish Mijozlar bilan muloyim va professional muomala qilish', 'Haydovchilik guvohnomasi\r\nIsh tajribasi afzalroq\r\nMijozlarga xizmat ko‘rsatishda muloyimlik', 'Bosh jadval\r\nRag‘batlantirish va bonuslar\r\nKeng mijozlar bazasi\r\nTo‘lovlar o‘z vaqtida\r\n\r\nContact:\r\n📞 +998 93 890 10 30 (Yunusobod)\r\n📞 +998 94 611 00 06 (Sebzor)\r\n <p> 📱 <a href=\"https://www.google.ru/maps/place/41.374680,+69.300506/@41.3747607,69.2999959,18z/data=!4m4!3m3!8m2!3d41.3746802!4d69.3005055?hl=ru\" target=\"_blank\"> Yunusobod adres </a> <br> 📱 <a href=\" https://www.google.ru/maps/place/41%C2%B020\'14.1%22N+69%C2%B015\'29.2%22E/@41.3368057,69.2581835,18z/data=!4m4!3m3!8m2!3d41.337243!4d69.258108?hl=ru&entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDMxNy4wIKXMDSoJLDEwMjExNDU1SAFQAw%3D%3D\r\n\" target=\"_blank\"> Sebzor adres </a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a> </p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-03-20 05:29:56', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-20 05:27:58', '2025-03-20 05:29:56'),
(57, 'Sotuv Operatori (Qizlar va Yigitlar)', 'TedBook', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Sotuv operatori sifatida siz kompaniyaning mahsulotlarini sotishda bevosita qatnashasiz. Mijozlarga xizmat ko\'rsatish, mahsulot haqida to\'liq ma\'lumot berish va sotuv jarayonini boshqarish asosiy vazifalaringiz bo\'ladi.', 'upl/logo/1742460528_images (1).jpg', 'Mijozlarga mahsulot haqida batafsil ma\'lumot berish Sotuv jarayonini boshqarish va nazorat qilish Yangi mijozlarni jalb qilish Sotish rejalari bajarilishini ta\'minlash', 'Yosh: 18-25 gacha\r\nIshga masʼuliyat bilan yondashish\r\nOʻzbek tilida ravon soʻzlashish', 'Job Benefits:\r\n✅ Yangi ishchilar uchun bepul oʻquv kurslari\r\n✅ Qulay joylashuv (metrodan 3 daqiqalik yo\'l)\r\n✅ Yosh va kirishimli jamoa\r\n✅ Ibodat uchun yetarli sharoitlar mavjud\r\n✅ Eng faol xodimlar uchun sovg\'alar (tour paketlar, iPhone 14 Pro Max va h.k)\r\n✅ Talabalarni ham ishga taklif etamiz\r\n\r\nSalary: Oylik maosh oklad + bonus (har bir sotilgan mahsulot uchun)\r\n💰 3,300,000 dan 15,000,000 gacha\r\n\r\nWorking Hours:\r\n🕘 6/1 grafik\r\n\r\n9:00 – 17:00\r\n17:00 – 22:00\r\nContact:\r\n📝 Ishga kirish uchun maʼlumotnoma (rezyume)ngizni va telefon raqamingizni pastdagi telegram raqamlarga yuboring:\r\n📱 @ishtedbook\r\n📞 +998910419344\r\n📞 +998770220703\r\n📱 @Hatamoff\r\n\r\nComment:\r\n❗️ Diqqat: Agar ish beruvchi ishga kirish uchun pul soʻrasa, ishonmang. Biz eʼlonlarni imkon qadar tekshiramiz, lekin shubha uyg\'otsa siz ham oʻzingiz mustaqil tekshirib ko\'ring!\r\n\r\n <p> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\" https://t.me/ishtedbook” target=\"_blank\"> Apply via TedBook Telegram </a> </p>\r\n</p>', '15000000', '2025-03-20 08:48:48', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-03-20 08:47:29', '2025-03-20 08:48:48'),
(58, 'Sotuv Menejeri', 'Trucking Solutions', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Location: Toshkent shaxri, Yakkasaroy tumani, Janubiy Vokzal yonida\r\n\r\nType: Full-Time\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\nSales Manager sifatida siz kompaniyaning servisi haqida ma\'lumot berasiz va mijozlar bilan to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri muloqot qilasiz. Asosiy vazifangiz — mijozlarni jalb qilish va savdo jarayonlarini boshqarish. Ishni boshlashdan avval 1 haftalik bepul trening o‘tkaziladi, keyin imtihon bo‘ladi.', 'upl/logo/1742461116_7777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777777.jpg', 'Kompaniya servisi haqida batafsil ma\'lumot berish AMERIKA native speakerlari bilan to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri muloqot qilish Savdo jarayonini boshqarish Sotish rejalari bajarilishini ta’minlash', 'Yosh: 20 yosh va undan katta\r\nIELTS 6.5+ (7.0+ afzal)\r\nSoat 19:00 – 03:00 ish grafigiga moslashish\r\nExtrovert fe’l-atvorga ega bo‘lish\r\nIngliz tilida ravon muloqot qilish', '✅ Ish to‘liq o‘rgatiladi\r\n✅ Kasbiy o‘sish imkoniyati\r\n✅ Yuqori daromad topish\r\n✅ Qo‘shimcha bonus va rag‘batlantirishlar\r\n✅ Har hafta Pizza va Coffee Breaklar\r\n✅ Qiziqarli Teambuildinglar\r\n\r\nSalary:\r\n💰 3,700,000 – 20,000,000 (FIX + KPI)\r\n\r\nWorking Hours:\r\n🕘 19:00 – 03:00\r\n\r\nContact:\r\n📝 Ishga kirish uchun maʼlumotnoma (rezyume)ngizni quyidagi telegram raqamga yuboring:\r\n📱 @Khujamov_1\r\n\r\nComment:\r\n❗️ Diqqat: Agar ish beruvchi ishga kirish uchun pul soʻrasa, ishonmang. Biz eʼlonlarni imkon qadar tekshiramiz, lekin shubha uyg\'otsa siz ham oʻzingiz mustaqil tekshirib ko\'ring!\r\n <p> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\" https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-Fi_94Tuh8&feature=youtu.be” target=\"_blank\"> BrighBridge YouTube</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\" https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScV3f3F2z9-uNHromDPfX6lybW91u0Ry6OVB036dPE5xdjlgg/viewform” target=\"_blank\"> Apply via Form </a> </p>\r\n</p>', '20000000', '2025-03-20 09:00:12', 1, 0, 3, 6, '2025-03-20 08:56:23', '2025-03-20 09:00:12'),
(59, 'Cashier/ Kassir', 'LOOOK (Oilaviy restorani)', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', '“LOOOK” oilaviy restorani Toshkent shahridagi turli filiallar uchun kassir, oshxona xodimi, xostess, moyka xodimi va kuryer lavozimlariga ishga qabul qiladi. Rasmiy ro’yxatdan o’tiladi. Ish vaqti smenali, kuniga 9 soat (tushlik vaqtini qo‘shgan holda), haftasiga 5 yoki 6 kun ishlash imkoniyati mavjud.', 'upl/logo/1750010227_download.png', '•	Xaridorlarga tez va samimiy xizmat ko‘rsatish •	Kassa apparatini boshqarish •	Buyurtmalarni qabul qilish va to‘lovlarni amalga oshirish •	Tozalik va tartibni saqlash •	Mehmonlarni kutib olish (xostess) •	Ovqatlarni tayyorlashda yordam berish (oshxona xodimi) •	Yetkazib berish xizmatini bajarish (kuryer)', '•	Tajriba talab qilinmaydi – o‘zimiz o‘rgatamiz\r\n•	Mas\'uliyatli va e\'tiborli bo‘lish\r\n•	Jamoa bilan ishlash qobiliyati\r\n•	Rus yoki ingliz tilini bilganlarga afzallik (+10% maosh)\r\n⏰Grafik: \r\n✏️-smena: 08:00 dan 17:00  gacha \r\n✏️-smena: 17:00 dan 02:00 gacha', '•	Rasmiy ish joyi\r\n•	Bozordagi o‘rtacha oylik + bonuslar\r\n•	Kuniga 1 mahal bepul ovqat\r\n•	O‘z vaqtida beriladigan ta\'til\r\n•	O‘sish va treninglar imkoniyati\r\n•	Chet el safarlari imkoniyati\r\n•	Xodimlarni qo‘llab-quvvatlash dasturlari\r\n•	Yoqimli va do‘stona jamoa\r\nMarkaziy oshxonamiz safini kengaytirmoqdamiz. \r\n\r\nBizga kerak: \r\n- tovuq kesuvchi \r\n- tovuq marinovka qiluvchi\r\n- tovuq yuvuvchi\r\n- salat tayyorlovchi\r\n\r\nBizga kerak : \r\n- kassir \r\n- oshxona xodimi \r\n- xostess \r\n- moyka xodimi\r\n- kuryer\r\n\r\n📍Adres: \r\n🔸🔸🔸\r\n• Yangi yo\'l filiali\r\n• Markaziy oshxona ( Ⓜ️ Chilonzor ) \r\n• City Boulevard ( Ⓜ️ Xalqlar do’stligi) \r\n• High Town ( Ⓜ️ Yunusobod) \r\n• Markaziy oshxona ( Ⓜ️ Chilonzor ) \r\n• Yunusobod ( Ⓜ️ Yunusobod ) \r\n• Maksim Gorkiy  ( Ⓜ️ Buyuk ipak yo’li) \r\n• Beruniy ( Ⓜ️ Beruniy) \r\n\r\n➡️Kontakt:\r\n@loookvacancybot dan o’z arizangizni qoldiring va biz siz bilan aloqaga chiqamiz !\r\n\r\n\r\n❗️Diqqat: Agar ish beruvchi ishga kirish uchun pul so‘rasa, ishonmang. Biz eʼlonlarni imkon qadar tekshiramiz, lekin shubha uyg\'otsa siz ham o‘zingiz mustaqil tekshirib ko‘ring!', 'Negotiable', '2025-06-15 17:57:07', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-06-15 17:55:25', '2025-06-15 17:57:07'),
(60, 'Accountant', 'IT Park', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'We are seeking a detail-oriented and experienced Accountant to manage financial transactions, prepare accurate financial reports, ensure compliance with tax regulations, and support budgeting processes. The ideal candidate will play a key role in maintaining the financial health of the organization.', 'upl/logo/1751958678_1740469563_Без_названия_-_Copy.png', 'Prepare and maintain financial statements and reports  Manage accounts payable and receivable  Reconcile bank statements and monitor company accounts  Assist in the preparation of budgets and forecasts  Ensure compliance with tax and financial regulations  Conduct internal audits and support external audits  Maintain accurate and up-to-date records of all financial transactions', 'Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field\r\n\r\nMinimum 2 years of relevant accounting experience\r\n\r\nStrong knowledge of accounting principles and tax regulations\r\n\r\nProficiency in MS Excel and accounting software (e.g., 1C, QuickBooks, SAP)\r\n\r\nAttention to detail and accuracy in financial reporting\r\n\r\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills\r\n\r\nGood communication and organizational abilities', 'Competitive salary package\r\n\r\nProfessional development opportunities\r\n\r\nFriendly and collaborative work environment\r\n\r\nPaid vacation and official holidays\r\n\r\nHealth and wellness support', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-08 17:27:48', 1, 0, 11, 13, '2025-07-08 07:13:34', '2025-07-08 07:13:34'),
(62, 'test', 'IT Park', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Part-time', 'test', 'upl/logo/1751958678_1740469563_Без_названия_-_Copy.png', 'test', 'test', 'test', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-08 17:29:19', 0, 0, 6, 13, '2025-07-08 17:29:19', '2025-07-08 17:29:19'),
(63, 'Kitchen & Service Staff (Tovuq tayyorlovchi, Kassir, Xostess, Moykachi, Kuryer)', 'LOOOK (Oilaviy restorani)', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'LOOOK — oilaviy restoranlar tarmog‘i o‘zining markaziy oshxonasi va filiallariga yangi xodimlarni ishga qabul qilmoqda. Rasmiy ro‘yxatdan o‘tiladigan ish, grafik asosida smenali ish vaqti, qulay sharoitlar hamda o‘z vaqtida to‘lanadigan oylik taklif etiladi.', 'upl/logo/1753772229_photo_2025-05-01_00-53-49.jpg', 'Tovuqni kesish, yuvish va marinovka qilish  Salatlar tayyorlash  Kassada ishlash  Mijozlarni kutib olish (xostess)  Buyurtmalarni yetkazib berish (kuryer)  Oshxonada tozalik va gigienani saqlash', 'Tajriba talab qilinmaydi — o‘rgatiladi\r\n\r\nRus yoki ingliz tilini bilish ustunlik beradi\r\n\r\nMas’uliyatli va jamoada ishlay oladigan bo‘lish\r\n\r\nO‘z vaqtida ishga kelish va sanitariya qoidalariga rioya qilish', 'Bozordagi o‘rtacha oylik\r\n\r\n1 mahal bepul ovqat\r\n\r\nO‘z vaqtida ta’til\r\n\r\nRus yoki ingliz tilini bilganlarga +10% bonus\r\n\r\nO‘sish uchun treninglar\r\n\r\nChet elga safar qilish imkoniyati\r\n\r\nXodimlarni qo‘llab-quvvatlash dasturlari\r\n\r\nYoqimli jamoa\r\n\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:19:58', 1, 0, 8, 6, '2025-07-29 06:55:57', '2025-07-29 10:19:58'),
(64, 'Administrator of Facilities (Xo‘jalik ishlari bo‘yicha mutaxassis)', 'OOO AVTOTEST REPORT', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Ko‘p tarmoqli binolar, inshootlar va atrof-muhit infratuzilmasini nazorat qilish va ekspluatatsiya jarayonlarini tashkil etish. Xizmat ko‘rsatish jarayonlarini samarali tashkil etuvchi, muhandislik tizimlarining ishlashiga javobgar va texnik xodimlarni boshqaradigan mutaxassis kerak.', 'upl/logo/1753772939_0511426_s.jpg', 'Bino va inshootlarning to‘g‘ri ishlashini ta’minlash  Muhandislik kommunikatsiyalarini (isitish, suv ta’minoti, shamollatish, elektr) nazorat qilish  Texnik xizmat ko‘rsatish va reja asosida ta’mirlash ishlarini tashkil qilish  Xodimlar va xizmat ko‘rsatish tashkilotlari ishini nazorat qilish  Budjet rejalashtirish va uning bajarilishini kuzatish  Yong‘in xavfsizligi vositalari va jihozlarning holatini nazorat qilish  Ombor va xona bo‘yicha inventarizatsiya yuritish  Hujjatlarni elektron va qog‘oz shaklda to‘g‘ri yuritish  Materiallar va asbob-uskunalarni binoda aniq joylashuv asosida hisobda yuritish', 'O‘rta maxsus yoki oliy ma’lumot, kamida 3 yillik ish tajribasi\r\n\r\nMuhandislik tizimlarining ishlash tamoyillarini bilish\r\n\r\nQurilish, ta’mirlash, montaj texnologiyalaridan xabardorlik\r\n\r\nXodimlarni boshqarish va motivatsiya berish ko‘nikmalari\r\n\r\nTashkiliy va hujjatlashtirish jarayonlarini bilish\r\n\r\nMehnat muhofazasi, sanitariya va yong‘in xavfsizligi qoidalari bo‘yicha bilimlar', 'Rasmiy ishga qabul\r\n\r\n6 kunlik ish haftasi\r\n\r\nMehnat kodeksiga asosan qo‘shimcha ish haqi\r\n\r\n21 kunlik mehnat ta’tili\r\n\r\nOylik o‘z vaqtida to‘lanadi\r\n\r\nXizmat avtomobili beriladi\r\n\r\n8 kishilik texnik xodimlar guruhini boshqarish imkoniyati\r\nIshga riza topshirish: https://beta.wejob.uz/apply-job/108862276/', '15000000', '2025-07-29 07:15:26', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-07-29 07:07:30', '2025-07-29 07:15:26'),
(65, 'Translator (International Consulting Company)', 'Annexure International Сonsulting Сompany', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Annexure International Consulting Company has been operating in Uzbekistan since 2019, with its head office based in Hong Kong. Our projects are funded by international financial institutions and implemented at the state level. This provides a unique opportunity to collaborate with global companies and financial organizations.\r\n\r\nWe are currently hiring a Translator. This is a great opportunity for recent graduates to gain valuable experience in consulting and international project development. You will also be trained on how to participate in and prepare tender documentation for international projects.', 'upl/logo/1753773287_annexurefs_logo.jpg', 'Translate documents (written and verbal) accurately and professionally  Support consultants in project documentation  Assist in preparing application packages for international tenders  Collaborate with team members on various consulting projects', 'University degree (open to recent graduates)\r\n\r\nProficiency in English (both written and spoken)\r\n\r\nStrong computer literacy\r\n\r\nWillingness to learn and work in a team-oriented environment', 'Comfortable office located in the city center\r\n\r\nOpportunity to learn from experienced professionals\r\n\r\nParticipation in international-level projects\r\n\r\nOngoing support and mentorship for newcomers\r\n\r\nFriendly and dynamic team culture\r\n📩 To apply, please send your CV to: hr@annexurefs.com\r\n📱 Or contact via phone/Telegram: +998 97 776 00 96 (Ms. Umida)', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 07:14:54', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-07-29 07:12:48', '2025-07-29 07:14:47'),
(66, 'Project Manager Intern (Entry-Level)', 'Nura Group', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Internship', 'Nura Group is inviting recent graduates and final-year students to apply for the role of Project Manager Intern. This is an excellent opportunity to gain hands-on experience in project management within a dynamic and supportive environment. The internship is ideal for motivated individuals looking to kickstart their careers and contribute to real projects with meaningful impact.', 'upl/logo/1753776627_photo_2025-07-25_09-52-55.jpg', 'Assist with project planning and task execution  Coordinate with internal teams, clients, and stakeholders  Track project progress and report performance updates  Identify potential project risks and support mitigation planning  Maintain accurate project documentation and reports', 'Final-year student or recent graduate in Electrical Engineering, Project Management, or a related field\r\n\r\nStrong organizational and time-management skills\r\n\r\nExcellent communication and interpersonal abilities\r\n\r\nProficient in Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint)\r\n\r\nTeam-oriented with a willingness to take initiative\r\n\r\nCurious and eager to learn new skills', 'Practical, hands-on training from experienced professionals\r\n\r\nExposure to real-world projects and challenges\r\n\r\nSupportive team culture and mentorship\r\n\r\nGrowth opportunities and career path development\r\n\r\nCompetitive compensation and benefits\r\nSend your CV and a short note about your interest in the role via Telegram: @Nura_munisa\r\n📱 For more information, contact: +998 99 987 30 33\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:20:58', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-07-29 08:09:54', '2025-07-29 10:20:58'),
(67, 'Multiple Positions — Project Manager, Implementation Specialist, Office Manager, Assistant Manager', 'Bering Services', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Bering Servis, the official representative of leading internationally recognized textile equipment manufacturers, is expanding its team! We are currently hiring for multiple full-time positions:\r\n\r\nProject Manager\r\n\r\nProject Implementation Group Specialists\r\n\r\nOffice Manager\r\n\r\nAssistant Manager\r\n\r\nThese roles offer an exciting opportunity to grow in a dynamic, international business environment with a focus on client relations, project execution, and market development.', 'upl/logo/1753776835_photo_2025-07-29_13-11-29.jpg', 'Collaborate and communicate with international suppliers  Maintain strong relationships with clients  Conduct market research and support marketing efforts  Analyze sales markets for specific textile equipment  Participate in business meetings and negotiations  Support day-to-day office and project activities', 'Fluency in English, Uzbek, and Russian (both written and spoken)\r\n\r\nMDIS Tashkent graduates preferred\r\n\r\nExcellent interpersonal skills, punctuality, and resilience under pressure\r\n\r\nAbility to handle multiple tasks efficiently\r\n\r\nStrong translation skills (oral and written)\r\n\r\nConfident computer and office equipment user', 'Full-time office-based work\r\n\r\nProfessional environment with international exposure\r\n\r\nCompetitive salary package\r\nSend your resume to hr-beringservis@mail.ru\r\n📱 Or contact via Telegram/Phone: +998 93 576 25 28\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:20:39', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-07-29 08:13:19', '2025-07-29 10:20:39'),
(68, 'Teacher Assistant – Primary School', 'Canadian School (Uzbekistan)', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Canadian School (Uzbekistan) is seeking a caring, responsible, and creative Teacher Assistant to support its primary school classes. This role is ideal for someone passionate about nurturing young learners and supporting their academic and personal growth in a vibrant, international environment.', 'upl/logo/1753777198_photo_2025-07-28_17-50-47.jpg', 'Support teachers in delivering engaging lessons aligned with the primary school curriculum  Maintain a positive and disciplined classroom atmosphere  Provide one-on-one and small-group support to students  Communicate effectively with parents regarding student progress  Actively participate in school events and extracurricular activities', 'Teaching Skills: Ability to assist in lesson planning and delivery using diverse teaching methods\r\n\r\nChild Development: Understanding of developmental psychology in early education\r\n\r\nParental Engagement: Experience in conducting parent-teacher meetings and communication\r\n\r\nInstructional Resources: Ability to use textbooks and educational resources effectively\r\n\r\nStudent Wellbeing: Basic knowledge of hygiene, pediatric care, and first aid\r\n\r\nProfessional Development: Willingness to engage in continuous learning and training\r\n\r\nICT Literacy: Proficiency in using digital tools and technology for teaching\r\n\r\nPersonal Qualities: Patience, empathy, and the ability to work with students of varying abilities', 'Full-time, permanent position in a supportive and innovative school\r\n\r\nOpportunity to work with experienced educators and international standards\r\n\r\nCompetitive salary of 6,000,000 UZS per month\r\n\r\nContinuous professional development\r\n📨 Interested in joining a school that inspires young minds?\r\nContact us today to apply or get more information:\r\n📱 +998 50 797 60 89', '6000000', '2025-07-29 08:20:09', 1, 0, 7, 6, '2025-07-29 08:18:57', '2025-07-29 08:19:58'),
(69, 'Assistant Teacher with Knowledge of English', 'Invento International Kindergarten', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'We looked for a caring, energetic, and responsible Assistant Teacher to join our friendly team!\r\nIf you enjoyed working with children, spoke English at a conversational level, and wanted to grow in the field of education — we were happy to welcome you!', 'upl/logo/1753779431_photo_2025-07-21_11-55-58.jpg', 'Assisted the lead teacher in organizing lessons and activities ✔️ Ensured children\'s comfort and safety ✔️ Communicated with children in English ✔️ Maintained order in the classroom', 'Completed a degree in early childhood education or a related field\r\n\r\nHad good spoken Russian and English (minimum B1 level)\r\n\r\nShowed responsibility, patience, and love for children\r\n\r\nHeld a degree in a relevant field (Bachelor’s or higher)\r\n\r\nHad previous experience working with children (a plus)', 'Working hours were 08:00–18:00\r\n\r\nProvided official employment from day one\r\n\r\nOffered paid vacation\r\n\r\n📩 To apply or get more information:\r\nSend a direct message or contact us at:\r\n📞 +998 99 633 99 99\r\n📨 Telegram: @HrInvento\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', '6000000', '2025-07-29 10:20:23', 1, 0, 7, 6, '2025-07-29 08:56:24', '2025-07-29 10:20:23'),
(70, 'Qidiruv Sifatini Yaxshilash Bo‘yicha Yetakchi Mutaxassis (O‘zbek bozorida)', 'Yandex Uzbekistan', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'Masofadan ishlash | Qisman bandlik | Moslashuvchan ish vaqti | Soatiga taxminan $3.5\r\n\r\nYandex’ning o‘zbek tilidagi qidiruv natijalarini yanada aniqroq va dolzarb qilish uchun Qidiruv Sifatini Yaxshilash Bo‘yicha Yetakchi Mutaxassis izlayapmiz. Agar siz o‘zbek tilida ravon so‘zlasha olsangiz, ma’lumot tahlili bilan tanish bo‘lsangiz va jamoani qo‘llab-quvvatlashni xohlasangiz, ushbu loyiha aynan siz uchun.', 'upl/logo/1753781320_orig.png', 'O‘zbek tilidagi qidiruv natijalarini baholash – aniqligi va ahamiyatini tekshirish  Ishtirokchilarga yordam ko‘rsatish – savollarga javob berish, foydali fikr-mulohazalar bildirish  Topshiriq bo‘yicha hujjatlarni yangilash – izchil sifatni ta’minlash  Murakkab holatlarni ko‘rib chiqish – tilshunoslik bo‘yicha chuqur bilim talab qilinadi  Yangi ishtirokchilarni tayyorlash va loyihaga jalb qilish  Ishtirokchilar bazasini baholash va umumiy jarayonlarni muvofiqlashtirishda yordam berish', 'O‘zbek tilini ona tili darajasida bilish, madaniy va tilshunoslik xabardorligi yuqori bo‘lishi\r\n\r\nIngliz tilini kamida o‘rta (Intermediate+) darajada bilish\r\n\r\nWeb-analitika vositalari va katta hajmdagi ma’lumotlar bilan ishlash tajribasi\r\n\r\nLoyihalarda ishtirok etgan yoki jamoalarni boshqargan bo‘lish\r\n\r\nDiqqatni talab qiladigan, takrorlanuvchi vazifalar bilan ishlashga tayyorlik\r\n\r\nMustaqil ishlash va turli topshiriqlarni bajarish qobiliyati', 'Tayyorgarlik kurslari yoki treninglarni tashkil qilish tajribasi\r\n\r\nQuyidagi OTMlardan biri bitiruvchisi yoki talabasi bo‘lish: TDIU, PDP, UzGUMYA, Moliya Instituti\r\n\r\nFrontend dasturlash, ma’lumotlar tahlili, yoki moliyaviy tahlil sohalarida bilimga ega bo‘lish\r\n\r\n💻 Ish sharoitlari:\r\nMasofadan ishlash, qulay grafik\r\n\r\nHaftasiga kamida 20 soat, kuniga kamida 4 soat ishlash\r\n\r\nMellow kompaniyasi orqali xizmat shartnomasi asosida ishlanadi (o‘zini o‘zi band qilganlar ham murojaat qilishi mumkin)\r\n\r\nTo‘lov: soatiga taxminan $3.5, bajarilgan topshiriqqa qarab\r\n\r\nIshga topshirish: https://crowd.yandex.com/mellow/search_quality_improvement#application-form\r\n\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:19:43', 1, 0, 6, 6, '2025-07-29 09:26:17', '2025-07-29 10:19:43'),
(71, 'Junior IT Auditor (Yosh IT auditor)', 'TBC Bank', 'Uzbekistan, Tashkent', 'Full-time', 'IT jarayonlarning samaradorligini baholash maqsadida ichki audit tekshiruvlarida jamoa tarkibida ishtirok etish;\r\n\r\nTekshiruv natijalari bo‘yicha hisobotlar va ish hujjatlarini tayyorlash;', 'upl/logo/1753784281_TBCbank_606.jpg', 'Aniqlangan kamchiliklarni bartaraf etish bo‘yicha tavsiyalar yozish va ularning bajarilishini nazorat qilish.', 'Nomzoddan kutilyotgan talablar:\r\nIT audit, axborot xavfsizligi yoki IT operatsiyalari sohasida kamida 1 yillik tajriba;\r\n\r\nAxborot texnologiyalari bo‘yicha asosiy bilimlar (audit, xavfsizlik, dasturlash yo‘nalishlarida) — afzal;\r\n\r\nOliy ma’lumot (texnik yoki IT, axborot xavfsizligi, amaliy matematika/dasturlash yo‘nalishlari bo‘yicha);\r\n\r\nMS Office dasturlarida yaxshi ko‘nikmalar;\r\n\r\nRus, o‘zbek va ingliz tillarini bilish.', 'Biz taklif qilamiz:\r\nIsh grafigi: 5/2, soat 10:00–19:00;\r\n\r\nQulay ofis (Oʻybek/Abdulla Qodiriy metro bekatlari yaqinida);\r\n\r\nKasbiy va shaxsiy rivojlanish uchun treninglar va kurslar;\r\n\r\nKorporativ ingliz tili darslari;\r\n\r\nMultimadaniyatli jamoada ishlash imkoniyati;\r\n\r\nTibbiy sug‘urta (sinov muddatidan so‘ng);\r\n\r\n3 oylik sinov muddati (to‘liq haq to‘lanadi);\r\n\r\nRaqobatbardosh ish haqi (nomzod bilan alohida kelishiladi);\r\n\r\nJamoaviy tadbirlar va sport faoliyatlari;\r\n\r\nFoydali va mazali tamaddilar.\r\n\r\nRezyume yarating: https://brightbridge.uz/cv\r\n\r\n📧 Rezyume yuborish:\r\nEmail: job@tbcbank.uz\r\nTelegram: @tbc_bank_hr_bot\r\nYoki ushu linkka kiring: https://tbcbank.uz/ru/vacancies/151/%20/\r\n<br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>', 'Negotiable', '2025-07-29 10:18:29', 1, 0, 11, 6, '2025-07-29 10:12:05', '2025-07-29 10:18:01');
