(26, 'Career Fair', 'MDIST Professional Development Centre invites you to a Career Fair on May 1, 2025.', 'Dear MDIST Students and Alumni,\r\n\r\n     🌟 MDIST Professional Development Centre invites you to a Career Fair on May 1, 2025.\r\n\r\n   🚀 This event presents a valuable opportunity to 💻connect with potential employers, explore internship opportunities, and gain insights into various industries.\r\n\r\n📅 Date: May 1, 2025\r\n⏰ Time: 14:00 - 17:00\r\n📍Venue: LRC 3rd & 4th floor, (B-block)\r\n\r\n\r\n❗️ To ensure a professional and successful experience, please take note of the following requirements:\r\n\r\n👩🏻‍💼🧑🏻‍💼Dress Code: Casual or Smart Casual attire\r\n\r\n📋CV Submission: Please prepare and bring hard copies of your CV/resume and ensure you have few copies to share with company representatives\r\n\r\nFor any inquiries or further assistance, please feel free to visit us at 📍A Block, Room 109, or contact at 📧careercentre@mdist.uz.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nProfessional Development Centre\r\n\r\n🌐 Telegram channel (https://t.me/PDC_MDIST)', 'upl/blog/1745800114_photo_2025-04-28_05-28-00.jpg', '0', 5, '2025-04-28 00:28:34', '2025-04-28 00:28:34'),
