(29, 'We Asked Students Tough Interview Questions', 'Here’s What Happened!', '</h2> <p><strong> We Asked Students Tough Interview Questions… Here’s What Happened!</strong></p> <p> A job interview (mock) session was held where students participated as interviewees. Each student was assessed on key competencies such as communication, confidence, and problem-solving. Interviewers provided structured feedback to help students identify strengths and areas for improvement, enhancing their readiness for real-world job interviews. </strong Talabalar ishtirokida sinov (mock) ish suhbati o‘tkazildi. Har bir ishtirokchi muloqot, ishonch va muammoni hal qilish kabi asosiy ko‘nikmalar bo‘yicha baholandi. Intervyuerlar tomonidan har bir talabaga kuchli jihatlari va takomillashtirish zarur bo‘lgan tomonlari bo‘yicha tahlilli fikr-mulohazalar bildirildi. Ushbu jarayon talabalarni haqiqiy ish suhbatlariga yanada puxta tayyorlashga xizmat qildi.</p> <h3>Watch Full video for more details.</li> <p> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9_VC834ZcGI\">Watch\" target=\"_blank\"> 📥 Watch and learn </a> <p> 🌐 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz\" target=\"_blank\">BRIGHTBRIDGE.UZ</a> <br> </p> <p> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> </p> <p>✉️ <a href=\"mailto:brightbridge_support@gmail.com\">brightbridge_support@gmail.com</a></p>', 'upl/blog/1748862338_Black_and_Green_Modern_Interview_Podcast_Youtube_Thumbnail.png', 'https://youtu.be/9_VC834ZcGI', 1, '2025-06-02 11:05:39', '2025-06-02 11:05:39'),
(31, 'Service Quality in Higher Education | Central Asia 2030', 'III Forum \"Global and National Economic Trends: Uzbekistan – 2030\" Conference III: Central Asia 2030 – The Future of Regional Cooperation and Connectivity', '</h2> <p><strong> Service Quality in Higher Education | Central Asia 2030\r\n</strong></p> <p> Central Asia 2030 Forum hosted by Westminster International University in Tashkent, where we explore how Total Quality Management (TQM) and the SERVQUAL framework can transform service quality in higher education institutions. </strong In this session, Abbos Utkirov presents key insights on integrating quality management practices to enhance both student experience and institutional performance.. </p> <p> <strong>✅ Learn how TQM principles drive continuous improvement:</strong> ✅ Understand the 5 key SERVQUAL dimensions <br> <strong>✅ Discover practical strategies for applying these models in universities</p> <h3>Click here for more details:</li> <p> <a href=\" https://conference.wiut.uz/CA2030 \">Conference III: Central Asia 2030 – The Future of Regional Cooperation and Connectivity</a> <p> 🌐 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz\" target=\"_blank\">BRIGHTBRIDGE.UZ</a> <br> </p> <p> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\"> PDC Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> </p>', 'upl/blog/1750008639_youtube.png', 'https://youtu.be/OtUyNjkGDM4', 5, '2025-06-15 17:30:39', '2025-06-15 17:36:07'),
(32, 'Trenerlar Uchun Eksklyuziv Trening (ToT)', 'Inter University Incubator', '<h2>Trenerlar Uchun Eksklyuziv Trening (ToT)</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Startaplar va universitet tadbirkorligini rivojlantirishga qiziquvchilar uchun noyob imkoniyat!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📅 Date:</strong> 2025-yil 20-iyun<br>\r\n<strong>⏰ Time:</strong> 10:00–12:00<br>\r\n<strong>📍 Venue:</strong> Toshkent Davlat Iqtisodiyot Universiteti (Amir Temur ko‘chasi 60A)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>👔 Trening kimlar uchun?</strong><br>\r\nUniversitet inkubatorlari va akseleratorlari koordinatori va menejerlari, tadbirkorlik yo‘nalishidagi o‘qituvchilar.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Nimalar o‘rganiladi?</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>Startap akseleratsiyasi metodlari</li>\r\n    <li>Tadbirkorlik ta’limi bo‘yicha ilg‘or yondashuvlar</li>\r\n    <li>Xalqaro hamkorlik imkoniyatlari</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🌐 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz\" target=\"_blank\">BRIGHTBRIDGE.UZ</a></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/mdist_business\" target=\"_blank\">Business Incubation Centre</a><br>\r\n📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a><br>\r\n📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a><br>\r\n📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>\r\n</p>\r\n', 'upl/blog/1750348729_Blue_White_Minimalist_Animated_Startup_Pitch_Deck_Presentation.png', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=is5jR1iCKKs', 3, '2025-06-19 15:58:49', '2025-06-19 15:58:49'),
(33, 'How to Evaluate Sources Using the CRAAP Test/ CRAAP testi yordamida manbalarni qanday baholash mumkin?', 'CRAAP testi (Yangiligi, Dolzarbligi, Muallifligi, Aniqligi, Maqsadi)', '</h2> \r\n<!-- English Version -->\r\n<p><strong>🎥 How to Evaluate Sources Using the CRAAP Test</strong></p> \r\n<p>Our latest video demonstrates how the CRAAP Test (Currency, Relevance, Authority, Accuracy, Purpose) can be applied in real-world situations to assess both online and offline sources. This is a must-watch for students, researchers, and anyone seeking to improve the quality of their information.</p> \r\n<p><strong>✅ Learn to spot trustworthy sources:</strong> ✅ Avoid misinformation in your research <br> \r\n<strong>✅ Apply the CRAAP method for academic, business, or personal use</strong></p> \r\n<h3>🔗 Click here to watch the video:</h3> \r\n<p><a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/craap-test-video\">CRAAP Test Video – Source Evaluation Made Simple</a></p> \r\n\r\n<!-- Uzbek Version -->\r\n<p><strong>🎥 CRAAP testi yordamida manbalarni qanday baholash mumkin?</strong></p> \r\n<p>Ushbu video orqali siz CRAAP testi (Yangiligi, Dolzarbligi, Muallifligi, Aniqligi, Maqsadi) qanday ishlashini amaliy misollar orqali ko‘rasiz. Bu usul onlayn va oflayn manbalarni tahlil qilishda ayniqsa foydalidir. Talabalar, tadqiqotchilar va sifatli axborot izlovchilar uchun ayni muddao!</p> \r\n<p><strong>✅ Ishonchli manbalarni aniqlashni o‘rganing</strong> ✅ Noto‘g‘ri axborotlardan qoching <br> \r\n<strong>✅ Ilmiy ish, biznes yoki shaxsiy foydalanish uchun qo‘llang</strong></p> \r\n<h3>🔗 Videoni bu yerda tomosha qiling:</h3> \r\n<p><a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/craap-test-video\">CRAAP testi haqida video – Manbalarni baholashning qulay usuli</a></p> \r\n\r\n<p>🌐 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz\" target=\"_blank\">BRIGHTBRIDGE.UZ</a> <br></p> \r\n<p>📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/PDC_MDIST\" target=\"_blank\">PDC Telegram</a> <br> \r\n📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Brightbridge Telegram</a> <br> \r\n📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> <br> \r\n📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a></p>', 'upl/blog/1753050295_Evaluating_sources__The_CRAAP_Test.mp4_snapshot_00.42.709.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r6qY7t3YHzw&t=317s', 1, '2025-07-20 22:24:55', '2025-07-20 22:24:55'),
(34, 'Qidiruv Sifatini Yaxshilash Bo‘yicha Yetakchi Mutaxassis (O‘zbek bozorida)', 'Masofadan ishlash | Qisman bandlik | Moslashuvchan ish vaqti | Soatiga taxminan $3.5', '<p>📌 <strong>Qidiruv Sifatini Yaxshilash Bo‘yicha Rahbar (O‘zbek bozorida)</strong> uchun imkoniyat eʼlon qilindi. Ushbu rolda siz Yandex Search tizimidagi kontent sifatini baholashda ishtirok etasiz. Bu masofaviy va moslashuvchan ish bo‘lib, onlayn platforma orqali amalga oshiriladi. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>🗓 <strong>Ariza topshirish muddati:</strong> ochiq (tezroq murojaat eting) <br>\r\n🌐 <a href=\"https://crowd.yandex.com/mellow/search_quality_improvement\" target=\"_blank\">To‘liq maʼlumotni ushbu sahifada ko‘ring</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>🔍 O‘zbek tilini mukammal bilsangiz va onlayn baholashda qatnashmoqchi bo‘lsangiz — bu imkoniyat aynan siz uchun!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>💡 O‘z bilimingizdan foydalaning, masofadan ishlang va Yandex loyihasiga hissa qo‘shing!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🌐 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz\" target=\"_blank\">BRIGHTBRIDGE.UZ</a> <br>\r\n🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Telegram</a> <br>\r\n📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> <br>\r\n📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>✉️ <a href=\"mailto:brightbridge_support@gmail.com\">@brightbridge_support</a></p>', 'upl/blog/1753782532_Green_Yellow_Modern_Professional_Business_Proposal_Presentation_.jpg', '0', 1, '2025-07-29 09:48:52', '2025-07-29 10:13:27'),
(35, 'Startup Challenge 2025', 'BrightBridge mentoring at Team niversity', '<p>📌 <strong>Startup Challenge 2025 – Tadbir yakunlari</strong> haqida eʼlon! 31-iyul kuni TEAM University’da energiya, ustozlardan mahorat darslari va haqiqiy tadbirkorlik ruhi hukm surdi. Tadbir davomida qatnashchilar marketing, moliya va pitch bo‘yicha amaliy bilim va ko‘nikmalarini oshirish imkoniyatiga ega bo‘lishdi.</p> \r\n\r\n<p>🗓 <strong>Tadbir sanasi:</strong> 31-iyul 2025 <br> 🌐 <a href=\"https://t.me/TEAMuniversityuz\" target=\"_blank\">Batafsil maʼlumotni ushbu sahifada ko‘ring</a></p> \r\n\r\n<p>🔍 Natijada 3 ta jamoa TEAM University’da o‘qish uchun 19 million so‘mgacha bo‘lgan grant yutib oldi.</p> \r\n\r\n<p>💡 Tadbir ishtirokchilari, spikerlar va homiylar ilhom manbai bo‘ldi — barchangizga katta rahmat!</p> \r\n\r\n<p>🌐 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz\" target=\"_blank\">BRIGHTBRIDGE.UZ</a> <br> 🖥 <a href=\"https://brightbridge.uz/cv\" target=\"_blank\">Rezyume yarating</a> va biz bilan kelajagingizni shakllantiring!</p> \r\n\r\n<p>📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/jobcare.uz/\" target=\"_blank\">Telegram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> <br> 📱 <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/brightbridge\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a></p> \r\n\r\n<p>✉️ <a href=\"mailto:brightbridge_support@gmail.com\">@brightbridge_support</a></p>', 'upl/blog/1754856549_photo_2025-08-04_11-19-57.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Ao26rSMZ-vs', 3, '2025-08-10 20:09:09', '2025-08-11 06:28:03');

